Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，准备了，专心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度，我是速度
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.60,0:00:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,1个赢家，41个输家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把输家当早餐吃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我该吃早餐，可能会比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:01:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不…保持专心，速度
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,疾如风，快如电
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.40,0:01:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是“闪电”！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.20,0:01:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿， “闪电”，准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.10,0:01:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，“闪电”早就准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,咔嚓！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:10.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,《赛车总动员》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来买天线球喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊， “闪电”！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.60,0:02:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇喔！ 你说对了，滑头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回到戴诺可400
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.50,0:03:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是鲍伯，跟我的好朋友达洛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.30,0:03:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛车进行到一半了，今天可能是赛车史上重要日子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍伯，现在我的油压暴升
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛要是更刺激的话，恐怕我得被拖着出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是的，达洛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,三部领先的车，以相同的积分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.90,0:03:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入本季最后一场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场比赛的胜利者， 将赢得季冠军头衔，跟活塞奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.90,0:03:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,绰号“冠军”的史崔威勒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.70,0:03:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是能在退休以前再夺得一次胜利呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是戴诺可赞助多年的金童
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能赢得最后一个活塞奖杯呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:04:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有就是一如往常的，第二名“路霸”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.80,0:04:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他的赛车生涯中，始终都位居第二
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,路霸以为今年是他的幸运年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.40,0:04:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于有机会脱离“冠军”史崔威勒的阴影
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他万万没想到半路杀出个程咬金， “闪电”麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.30,0:04:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗，我看没有人想到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.50,0:04:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位菜鸟新秀，原本是个无名小子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.80,0:04:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在大家都认识他了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.30,0:04:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会是第一个赢得活塞奖杯， 跟戴诺可赞助的菜鸟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛车传奇，亚军，和菜鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.10,0:04:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,三部车，一个冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不，你休想！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.40,0:04:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.40,0:04:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，闪电，快啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.70,0:05:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,超过去，麦坤！超过去！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你！ “闪电”！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴诺可是我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.30,0:05:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有状况，第三弯道！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.30,0:05:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲过来啊，麦坤 不好，领先车的后面撞成了一团
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.40,0:05:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，达洛，麦坤冲进车阵了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个菜鸟绝对不可能过得去！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.80,0:05:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少不是毫发无伤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:05:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,“闪电”！喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看！麦坤过去了耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐！ “闪电”麦坤精彩突围
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！咔嚓！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤！麦坤！麦坤！ 麦坤！麦坤！麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶，麦坤！咔嚓！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,当其他赛车都进维修站的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤继续跑，取得领先
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我退出啊，教练 我还可以跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈，你们觉得怎么样？很厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤他不休息！ 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不进站！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.00,0:06:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，快让我出站 快！快让我回去，快！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.20,0:06:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤居然不进站维修！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.00,0:06:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个菜鸟刚开除了他的总机械师， 那是本季第三位了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自个儿说喜欢独立自主的 跑！跑！跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,路霸被维修给耽搁了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，停了那么久，他可有一大段路要追呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,男士们，准备好，要开始喽！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 让开 让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要轮胎！快点！快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.70,0:07:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不！不要轮胎，汽油就好 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要轮胎，你这白痴！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来麦坤今天只打算加了汽油就跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.00,0:07:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，还是不换轮胎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常我会说这就像是在炒短线
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.20,0:07:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是对他挺有效的！嘿嘿，显然他懂的比我们多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,决胜时刻到了，达洛，只剩一圈 闪电麦坤遥遥领先
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，他赢定了，把庆功宴准备好吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的赛车王就要产生喽！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,方格旗，我来喽！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，糟了！麦坤爆了一个轮胎！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩最后一个弯道，他撑得住吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤爆胎了！麦坤爆胎了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快快！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.40,0:08:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又爆了一个轮胎！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.20,0:08:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,“冠军”跟“路霸”急起直追！ 他们进入第三弯道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.20,0:08:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信我的眼睛！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,“闪电”麦坤距离活塞奖杯只差一百英尺！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,“冠军”和“路霸”通过第四弯道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来到直线跑道了 结果是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.60,0:09:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在是太接近了，根本看不出来啊 不敢相信！我真不敢相信！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们爱你， “闪电”！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.10,0:09:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是我们赛车史上最精彩，
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.20,0:09:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,最叹为观止， 最不可思议的结局啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们连谁赢了都不知道 看看！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.50,0:09:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,太接近了，怎么看啊 可以再放一次吗？请再放一次
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！不准照相！快走开！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在胜利之道等候赛车结果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤，不换胎是很冒险的举动哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还用说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会不会后悔没有总机械师
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.80,0:09:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵，柯琳 赛车不光是只为了赢，还有别的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.30,0:09:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说领先一整圈赢得冠军 这样有什么看头啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要给赛车迷一点刺激
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.20,0:09:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,剌激？ 我后不后悔没有总机械师？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不后悔，因为我是个人秀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？喔，是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，那是非常有自信的“闪电”麦坤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.30,0:09:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,记者柯琳·泰伯薇在胜利之道的现场报道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.00,0:09:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，别挡镜头 嘿，查理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做什么啊？你挡到镜头了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都想看闪电 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后一点 嘿，够了，我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.30,0:10:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉呀，你们要去哪儿啊 我们辞职，个人秀先生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊，走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵，我要上哪去找能帮我加油的组员呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见，查理 我的名字不叫查理！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，随便了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，闪电！呦，麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的，刚才的冲刺可真精彩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.30,0:10:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎进入路霸的年代
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.20,0:10:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,活塞奖杯是我的，我的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，各位，我开戴诺可蓝色车怎么样？戴诺可蓝！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别做梦了，雷鸣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀，雷鸣？他在说什么？ 不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为雷声总是在闪电后面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,呯！咔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们谁知道雷声这个玩笑 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好个平手的结局啊，你让戴诺可很骄傲哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,老德啊，这些年来你对我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我应该做的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论发生什么事 你都是我心目中的赢家，老公
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.30,0:11:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了，老婆 没有你我什么也不是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蜜亚 我是蒂亚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最崇拜你了 咔嚓！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，做我真好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.60,0:11:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，小姐们，够了 我们爱你， “闪电”！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.70,0:11:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，朋友，你真的很有胆识啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，冠军先生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你光是一个螺丝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就比很多车子拥有更多赛车细胞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？这个… 但是你很笨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？ 这不是独角戏啊，孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要放聪明点 给自己找一个一流的总机师和伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.20,0:11:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想赢，一定要有好人才
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在背后支持，让他们做他们的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.70,0:12:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须要每个人同心协力 一流的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！ “闪电”！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.90,0:12:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你想清楚了，前途无可限量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，对，真的是非常好的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.50,0:12:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，冠军先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位女士先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,活塞杯赛车史上头一遭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.50,0:12:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位菜鸟赢得活塞奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们有三辆车平手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！麦坤，你一定很尴尬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我不会放在心上，因为尴尬的不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.20,0:13:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为今天的比赛有三位平手， 所以裁判决定，一星期后
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.70,0:13:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,将在加州举行三位领先者的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.10,0:13:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢！谢谢所有观众！谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.50,0:13:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，菜鸟，谁第一个到加州， 就可以单独跟戴诺可谈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不是我 你们才是最棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔耶！喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁第一个到加州，就可以单独跟戴诺可谈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就看看谁会先到，路霸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.20,0:13:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.40,0:13:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！小子，恭喜你争取到决赛 我不想谈这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，麦大叔，出发了 我的拖车到哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.70,0:13:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它停在你赞助者帐篷 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须亲自去露个脸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.10,0:14:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不、不、不不不不…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对对对，我是闪电麦坤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用新配方“清锈”保险杆除锈药膏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,“清锈”让生锈保险杆一擦见效
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！马上亮晶晶！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.50,0:14:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用“清锈” 你也能像我一样帅
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.40,0:14:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,咔嚓！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遇到来自沼泽的一辆车
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他锈得很严重，连影子都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以看见他肮脏的底盘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌生锈的车，这对我形象非常不好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.30,0:14:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要感谢他们的赞助 再说你签了合约
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，别说了，好吗？ 去牵拖车就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,冬天是个好季节 这一点没什么好争辩的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.80,0:14:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是要记住喔，那些盐跟灰尘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让你的螺丝钉生锈，螺丝帽结冰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你们看，他来了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.40,0:14:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,冠军角逐者
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过来，小子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:14:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电麦坤，你太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.30,0:15:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那场赛车真是精彩啊 对，你好快，麦坤
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，让我过一下 你是我的偶像！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.60,0:15:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤先生 是，我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗瑞 弗瑞，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.20,0:15:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我的名字！他知道我的名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错，弗瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.90,0:15:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏你了，让我们今年赚了不少
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，我们应该有足够的钱帮你买头灯喽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.00,0:15:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说他没有头灯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.10,0:15:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是这么说的，那些只是贴纸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道的 赛车不需要什么头灯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为跑道啊，一向都是明亮的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟是秃头，他还是需要头灯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位女士先生 闪电麦坤
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱歌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位知道吗？ “清锈保险杆药膏”车队
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.90,0:15:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天表现的非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有，别忘了，只要一点“清锈”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上大量的运气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也可以像我一样帅 咔嚓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.00,0:16:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，小子 我们爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.60,0:16:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们期盼明年也是业绩长红
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟今年一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,明年我就不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别像我弟那样开车 是吗？别像我哥那样开车
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的加州，我们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴诺可，我们来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好舒服喔，哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问是全世界最快的赛车，闪电麦坤吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最棒的经纪人哈威吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你的经纪人真荣幸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎不忍心拿你一成的奖金 还有广告酬劳
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.50,0:18:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,永久的经纪权了 总之，好精彩的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.70,0:18:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没…我没看 可是听说你很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.30,0:18:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了，哈威
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，你有二十张加州决赛的票
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你拿给你朋友，你告诉我名字
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让哈威为你服务，好吗？宝贝 是，朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，有，嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.90,0:18:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我懂了，人气小子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.70,0:18:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友太多，不知道给谁好 嘿，你到城里来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好抽空来看你最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要跟你的好友吃顿饭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，这样很好，我们是应该…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:19:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得挂了，小子 让我知道情况，再见
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.60,0:19:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？小货车？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.70,0:19:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，麦大叔 你开到慢车道了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你载的是闪电麦坤耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要停一会就好了，小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.00,0:19:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要整夜赶路，一直到加州去 我们说好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,整夜？让我提醒你国家交通部规定… 拜托，麦大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要比路霸先到，跟戴诺可聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些打盹的卡车
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.40,0:19:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，小子，我不知道我能不能做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.20,0:19:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然可以，麦大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.70,0:19:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很容易啊，我陪你熬夜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.10,0:19:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一整夜？ 一整夜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:21:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿呦，DJ 干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.10,0:21:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一辆车在打瞌睡喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.10,0:21:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,音乐真好听
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.10,0:21:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，文哥，换车道了，老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.70,0:21:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,回你那边啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.10,0:21:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有碰到 你在渡假吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.70,0:21:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，糟了，大鼻！ 他要打喷嚏啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.10,0:21:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重身体
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.30,0:21:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不要边打瞌睡边开车
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.50,0:22:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦大叔！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.30,0:22:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦大叔！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.80,0:22:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦大叔！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.40,0:22:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，麦大叔！麦大叔！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.90,0:22:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦大叔！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.50,0:22:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦大叔 等等我！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.60,0:22:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦大叔！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.40,0:23:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦大叔！麦大叔！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.20,0:23:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦大叔！麦大叔…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！麦大叔！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.90,0:23:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦大叔！麦大叔！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.80,0:23:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是麦大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.00,0:23:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦大叔？我不是麦大叔 我是大卡车，拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.20,0:23:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,开你的头灯，白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.30,0:23:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦大叔…州际公路
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.50,0:23:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我辖区里休想超速
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.70,0:24:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，糗了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.60,0:24:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！也许他可以帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.20,0:24:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他向我开枪？ 他为什么向我开枪？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.60,0:24:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好多年没跑这么快了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.00,0:24:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的密封垫一定会裂开
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.90,0:24:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇行！蛇行！蛇行！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.30,0:24:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.00,0:24:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然蛇行，飙车狂
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.30,0:24:53.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（史丹利 我们的城镇奠基者 1909）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.60,0:25:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你，老兄 闪第三次都比较慢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.70,0:25:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,60年代太亏待你了，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.80,0:25:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？那不是州际公路
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.40,0:25:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.40,0:26:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是只有我看到，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.90,0:26:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.70,0:26:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你刮了我的漆
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.30,0:26:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的轮胎！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.20,0:27:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞走吧，史丹利，自由自在
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.10,0:27:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子，你的麻烦可大了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.00,0:27:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,记者正在洛杉矶国际赛车场
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.80,0:27:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一位决赛者闪电麦坤 他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.40,0:27:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚到赛车场 麦坤先生，旅途顺利吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.80,0:27:26.70,Title,0,0,0,0,,他真的要上《赛车女郎》杂志吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.80,0:27:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电，你的策略是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.00,0:27:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？我忘了擦挡泥板吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.10,0:27:34.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（闪电麦坤失踪了！！）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.20,0:27:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦傅脑怂统档酱锛又？但是麦坤不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.60,0:27:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛车“闪电麦坤”神秘失踪了 麦坤应该参加一场前所未有的…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.70,0:27:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,赞助厂商说不知道他在什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.20,0:27:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只希望“闪电”没事 我实在不希望他发生任何意外
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.80,0:27:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道什么比较难找 闪电麦坤还是肯跟他合作的总机械师
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.00,0:27:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不计代价，一定要找到闪电麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.20,0:28:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都在问同一个问题： 麦坤到底在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.10,0:28:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.30,0:28:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么地方啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.60,0:28:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,早啊，睡美人！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.80,0:28:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想你要多久才会醒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.40,0:28:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么就拿去，只要别伤害我
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.40,0:28:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮胎锁？ 为什么给我上轮胎锁？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.10,0:28:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？拜托 哈哈，你真好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.20,0:28:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你，我叫拖线
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.70,0:28:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖线？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.80,0:28:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，拖把的拖，不是脱衣服的脱
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.80,0:28:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？ 你…你不知道我的名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.20,0:28:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…我知道你的名字 你也叫拖线？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.70,0:28:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说，我必须在最短的时间内尽快赶到加州去 这是什么地方啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.60,0:28:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.00,0:28:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是化油器郡
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.60,0:28:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个可爱的小镇，叫油车水镇
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.10,0:28:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.00,0:29:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你认为这里很好 你应该参观镇上其他的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.60,0:29:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？ 我很想参观其他的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.60,0:29:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以只要你打开门，解开轮胎锁
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.50,0:29:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我就一起游览本地的风景好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.30,0:29:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶，好 怎么样，拖线？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.60,0:29:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷！ 拖线！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.20,0:29:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过，你可不可以跟被告说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.20,0:29:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.70,0:29:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就废话少说 把这个威胁道路的罪犯，拖去交通法庭
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.20,0:29:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会聊了，小老弟
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.40,0:29:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小老弟，真好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.60,0:29:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,油车水镇交通法庭即将开庭
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.40,0:29:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刮了我的漆 真该放把火把你烧了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.00,0:29:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得重新叠罐头 你弄坏道路，你是辆坏车
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.40,0:29:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴君！ 对啊，对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.50,0:29:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长，请告诉我，这到底还要多久？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.30,0:29:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很忙，得立刻赶到加州去
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.10,0:29:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的律师呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.40,0:29:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道，在大溪地吧 他在那里有一个度假屋
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.70,0:29:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当被告没有律师的时候 法庭会指派一个给他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.90,0:29:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要当他的律师啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.30,0:30:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，我可以，警长
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.70,0:30:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,请起立，法官大人韩大夫主审
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.80,0:30:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱现
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.00,0:30:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望韩大夫怜悯你这个可怜虫
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.40,0:30:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.70,0:30:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道谁破坏我的镇 警长
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.90,0:30:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拿下他的车盖
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.80,0:30:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要他坐牢，直到他烂掉 不，更正
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.60,0:30:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要他坐牢，直到监牢烂掉，压在他车顶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.40,0:30:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再把他移到新的坚牢，让那个监牢也烂掉
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.20,0:30:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.70,0:30:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他撵出去，警长
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.70,0:30:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要他离开我的法庭 我要他离开我的镇
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.20,0:30:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,本案终结 好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.80,0:30:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是一流的律师耶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.20,0:30:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，我迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.70,0:30:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,保时捷美眉，她一定是我的律师派来的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.70,0:30:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你来，不过没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.30,0:30:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要放我走 他要放你走？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.80,0:30:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，今天你的工作很轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.80,0:30:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要乖乖站在那儿 让我好好的看看你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.00,0:31:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我就不拐弯抹角了， 我…你…晚餐，咔嚓
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.00,0:31:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？噢！哦 咔嚓！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.70,0:31:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托！哦 我知道，这种反应我见多了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.90,0:31:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带给别人的感受 连他们自己都无法理解
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.20,0:31:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，吓着你了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.70,0:31:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…有一点，但我不要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.80,0:31:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我要去跟法官谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.60,0:31:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,做你该做的，宝贝 喔！但是小心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.30,0:31:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的人不是都像你一样那么上路 你懂我的意思吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.10,0:31:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,咔嚓！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.40,0:31:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会记住的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.50,0:31:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，拖线 你好，莎莉
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.30,0:31:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好 早安，莎莉
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.30,0:31:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识她？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.40,0:31:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是本镇的律师，也是我的未婚妻
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.40,0:31:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.50,0:31:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑的 她只是喜欢我的外表
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.60,0:31:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩大夫，你今天看起来真帅 你是不是调整了你的侧视镜？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.50,0:31:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎莉，你想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.30,0:31:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，拜托，让这个家伙修路 本镇很需要
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.70,0:31:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我知道他这型的，赛车
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.90,0:32:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,本镇最不需要赛车
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.10,0:32:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我不想这么做的喔 可是你让我别无选择
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.70,0:32:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位乡亲，你们都知道本镇的骄傲历史
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.70,0:32:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.20,0:32:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,油车水镇，原始道路
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.90,0:32:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是我们66号公路颈上的一颗荣耀宝石
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.60,0:32:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有责任也很乐意 服务行经这段公路的所有旅客
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.50,0:32:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅客？什么旅客？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.60,0:32:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别理他
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.80,0:32:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你们仔细想想 如果没有路让这些旅客行驶
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.20,0:32:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要怎么服务他们呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.60,0:32:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡布，你的店里有什么？ 轮胎
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.50,0:32:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有车子来呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.10,0:32:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就没办法卖轮胎，我会失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.50,0:32:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,芙蓉，你的店里有什么？ 我有汽油
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.40,0:32:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多汽油 好了，男士们，注意听
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.90,0:32:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,芙蓉，如果车子不能去 你的店里买汽油会怎么样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.50,0:32:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会没生意，然后… 我们就得离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.00,0:32:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果芙蓉关了她的店离开这里 我们会怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.20,0:33:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有汽油，我们就完了 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.90,0:33:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们不觉得那辆车 有责任帮我们修路吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.80,0:33:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看啊，唯一壮得可以修那道路的是大艾尔
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.10,0:33:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉丝，那家伙十五年前就离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.40,0:33:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你干吗提起他呀，糊涂虫
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.50,0:33:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，他可以修
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.60,0:33:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有足够的马力，所以你们要他做什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.40,0:33:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,修马路！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.00,0:33:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们的镇需要修复 耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.90,0:33:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家肃静
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.90,0:33:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事似乎由不得我了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.70,0:33:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！ 不！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.90,0:33:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚不应该邀请你去吃晚餐的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.40,0:33:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系，贴纸王，你可以请贝西
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.50,0:33:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天啊，你可以跟贝西工作
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.30,0:33:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是一个求之不得的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.00,0:33:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝西？谁是贝西？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.30,0:33:49.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（贝西）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.90,0:33:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是贝西 有史以来最好的一台铺路机
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.90,0:33:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在判决你做社区服务
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.00,0:33:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要在我的监督下修复那条马路
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.80,0:34:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？这地方疯了？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.20,0:34:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，我知道现在时机可能不对
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.50,0:34:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你欠我三万两千块的律师费哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.50,0:34:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.60,0:34:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要把你跟贝西接在一起 你要轻轻拉她
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.20,0:34:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是在开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.90,0:34:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从路的起点那儿开始
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.90,0:34:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直铺到路的尽头那儿结束
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.90,0:34:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妈呀
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.70,0:34:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…这…这要多久的时间啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.20,0:34:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个啊…做对的话，应该只要五天左右
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.80,0:34:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,五天？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.10,0:34:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我现在就应该在加州跟戴诺可见面
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.10,0:34:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你最好少说废话，开始工作
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.10,0:34:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,接起来吧，拖线 好的，遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.70,0:34:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘头喽！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.20,0:34:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我该…嗯…先把他勾住贝西
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.50,0:35:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再嗯…再拿掉轮胎锁
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.60,0:35:07.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（这么快就要走了？）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.40,0:35:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见，油车水 再见，贝西
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.50,0:35:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,加州，我来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.70,0:35:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，迎着风
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.20,0:35:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.30,0:35:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不…没油了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.70,0:35:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么可能会没油呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.70,0:35:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子啊，我们没你想像那么笨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.80,0:35:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可…可是…你们怎么…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.20,0:35:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们趁你昏迷抽了你的汽油
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.60,0:35:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,咔嚓
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.90,0:35:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,男士们 警长
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.30,0:35:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！警长
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.50,0:35:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮胎怎么在这儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.80,0:35:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在原来的地方比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.40,0:36:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇诺 小红，让开一下
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.40,0:36:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看那部性感的改装车
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.30,0:36:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？我以前很会吹口哨
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.20,0:36:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然现在不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.00,0:36:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有时候我的引擎本体里会有液体累积
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.90,0:36:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是韩大夫说他会修理 他几乎什么都能修
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.40,0:36:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们才让他当法官
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.80,0:36:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子啊，你真该听我唱“跟着我马车跑”
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.00,0:36:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们大老远
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.40,0:36:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是要来听我唱这个“跑”
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.30,0:36:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！天啊！这下可好了！ 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.20,0:36:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的幸运贴纸都被弄脏了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.10,0:36:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，那没什么，我帮你弄干净
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.40,0:36:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.20,0:36:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了，没这个必要
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.60,0:36:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！喂！大块头 对，你红色的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.00,0:36:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要水管 把我身上的脏东西冲掉
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.00,0:36:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.10,0:36:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是有点害羞 而且他恨你弄死他的花
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.60,0:36:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该忍受这些的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.20,0:37:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是速度和空气力学的精密仪器
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.10,0:37:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤到哪啦？ 我是很有名的赛车！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.40,0:37:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是很有名的赛车？真正的赛车？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.70,0:37:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，我是真正的赛车 你以为呢？看看我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.40,0:37:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一辈子都在注意赛车消息 一辈子
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.50,0:37:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你一定认识我，我是闪电麦坤
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.90,0:37:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电麦坤 对！对！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.00,0:37:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要向全世界呐喊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.10,0:37:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的兴奋到了无以复加的最高点
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.40,0:37:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识很多法拉利吗？ 不是，不是，不是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.00,0:37:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是跑欧洲巡回赛 我是跑活塞杯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.70,0:37:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？ 卡布只注意法拉利跑车
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊，我有没有看错啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.70,0:37:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,顾客上门了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.00,0:37:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,顾客上门了，各位 有顾客
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.50,0:37:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，大家冷静点 顾客上门了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.00,0:37:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等很久了，记住我们排练过的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.90,0:37:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拿出“营业中，欢迎光临”的牌子
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.50,0:38:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道该怎么做 好了，大家别慌，准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.10,0:38:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,志明，奇怪，我没看到任何匝道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.80,0:38:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,春娇，我很清楚我们在什么地方 是吗？我们在荒郊野外
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.30,0:38:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,老婆，拜托 两位好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.00,0:38:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临饰品谷的入口 油车水镇
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.10,0:38:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以优质服务和热诚好客闻名
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.40,0:38:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴为您服务
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.50,0:38:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么也不需要，谢谢你 亲爱的，问她怎么去州际公路
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.70,0:38:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有必要问路，春娇 我告诉过你，我知道该往哪里走，我…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.00,0:38:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,上回我们去谢科琵市的时候，他也是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.50,0:38:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是去参加狂欢节庆典，可是我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.40,0:38:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，好了 真的，我们不需要服务
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.50,0:38:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真正需要的是我自制美味的有机燃料
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.60,0:38:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不， 我的油箱无法消化
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.40,0:38:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只想找到州际公路 很高兴见到你，士兵
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.70,0:38:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,请到“士官长军品店”买你们需要的政府军用品
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.10,0:38:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,老公，军用品 我们有很多军用品了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.50,0:38:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的交通锥汽车旅馆那儿有张地图
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.90,0:38:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你们住宿的话 我们还供应好吃的免费早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.10,0:38:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,老公，她有地图 我不需要地图，我有GPS
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.90,0:39:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不需要地图，谢谢 要不要喝点什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.50,0:39:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,请到我的“芙蓉咖啡” 66号公路上的最佳燃料
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.50,0:39:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我们刚加过油
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.70,0:39:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们需要轮胎 请到在下卡布的轮胎店
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.60,0:39:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,店名叫“比萨斜塔”
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.20,0:39:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只想找到州际公路 可是你们一定需要烤漆
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.60,0:39:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷蒙帮你们烤得美美的 嘿，什么图案都行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.80,0:39:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是火焰图案.不 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.20,0:39:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是幽灵火焰图案
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.60,0:39:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们喜欢传统的细条纹？ 肯尼霍华风格，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.20,0:39:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！老公，你看，细条纹
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.20,0:39:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，不必了，我们要走了，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.90,0:39:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小小的纪念品，嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.30,0:39:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 有空再来，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.50,0:39:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道我们在哪 告诉你的朋友喔
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.30,0:39:44.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（绮丽孤峰 油车水镇）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.60,0:39:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，是，当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.70,0:39:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常谢谢你们，再见喽！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.00,0:39:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.20,0:39:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么去州际公路 哦？真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.50,0:39:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,春娇，不要 真的、真的、真的、真的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.20,0:39:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不是真的，可是听着…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.70,0:40:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是著名的赛车闪电麦坤 我被强押在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.40,0:40:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拜托你们通知我的伙伴 让他们来救我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.00,0:40:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我及时赶去加州，赢得活塞杯 你们懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.80,0:40:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.20,0:40:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走，这是真的，拜托你们 你们一定得帮我，别把我丢在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.10,0:40:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在蛮荒地带，我的智商正一秒一秒下降
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.30,0:40:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快变得跟他们一样了喽
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.30,0:40:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，别担心，他们知道我们的位置了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.50,0:40:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会告诉他们的朋友，等着瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.40,0:40:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上回到汉克威廉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.30,0:40:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 现在我们先听听活塞杯最新消息
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.10,0:40:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是没有闪电麦坤的踪影 在这同时路霸已经抵达加州
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.10,0:40:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为今天第一位在跑道上练习的赛车
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.60,0:40:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，很高兴能比其他对手先练习
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.80,0:40:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为抢得先机，对我有利
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.40,0:41:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿！麦坤，气死你
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.10,0:41:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖线，让我搞清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.50,0:41:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,路铺好了，我就可以走 是这样的，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.50,0:41:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是这么说的啊 好吧，别挡住我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.30,0:41:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要铺好这条路
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.30,0:41:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成了 完成？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.70,0:41:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,才一个钟头
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.00,0:41:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做好了，看，我完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.40,0:41:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要说一声谢谢，我就走 只要一声谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.90,0:41:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是第一个踏上新马路的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.10,0:42:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺平顺的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.00,0:42:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直糟透了 但是跟这个镇很相配
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.50,0:42:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小红
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.10,0:42:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.50,0:42:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，韩大夫说 我做好了就可以走，条件是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.80,0:42:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,条件是你把路修好，不是弄得更糟
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.30,0:42:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把它刮掉，重新开始
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.90,0:42:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！拜托，老爹 我不是推土机，我是赛车
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.10,0:42:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…是吗？ 那么我们来比一场怎么样啊？我和你
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.40,0:42:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？ 你和我，这是玩笑吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.30,0:42:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了，你走，我来修路
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.80,0:42:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了，你照我的方式修路
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.50,0:42:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩大夫，你在做什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.40,0:42:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要怪我没礼貌，韩大夫
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.30,0:42:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你从零到一百公里要多久？ 三年半够吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.10,0:42:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你应该没有什么好担心的了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.70,0:43:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？老古板 这是一个很好的主意，就比吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.10,0:43:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位，这场比赛只跑一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.70,0:43:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们跑到威利岗，绕过威利岗，然后回来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.40,0:43:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准碰撞，不准作弊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.90,0:43:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准吐口水，不准咬 不准施暴，不准伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.90,0:43:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,准洒油，不准推，不准挤 不准暗伤，不准霸占道路，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.10,0:43:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有不准闲逛
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.00,0:43:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度，我是速度
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.60,0:43:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有凯迪拉克的优雅，有BMW的劲爆
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.40,0:43:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友奇诺 一直希望能帮真正的赛车维修
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.90,0:43:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们比赛只有一圈，两位
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.80,0:43:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一圈，不需要维修
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.40,0:43:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个人秀 好，随你便
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.50,0:43:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要维修，你懂吗？ 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.50,0:43:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.10,0:43:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动你们的…引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.70,0:44:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊，你们看！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.20,0:44:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意，韩大夫 这下甭想把路修好了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.60,0:44:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡布
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.00,0:44:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,各就各位，预备
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.30,0:44:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一是为了钱，二是为表演
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.60,0:44:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,三是准备好，四是… 我真不敢相信，跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.70,0:44:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩大夫，旗子代表跑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.30,0:44:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得旗子？可以跑了，跑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.70,0:44:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，韩大夫，你在做什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.50,0:44:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天啊，我好像一开始就落后了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.20,0:44:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚一点总比不动好 走吧，拖线
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.40,0:44:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能需要一点帮忙 呃…好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.80,0:44:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带了绳索了？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.40,0:44:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，我一向都带着绳索，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.60,0:44:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.70,0:45:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.60,0:45:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.20,0:45:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！这一招有凯迪拉克的优雅吗？ 还是有BMW的劲爆啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.30,0:45:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我糊涂了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.70,0:45:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开车跟你修路一样
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.90,0:45:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,差劲！钓上来吧，拖线
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.50,0:45:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他好像知道你会出事哦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.50,0:45:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，拖线，谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.70,0:45:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以在泥土上转弯的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.70,0:45:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.20,0:45:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，现在我落后了一天 我永远别想离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.80,0:45:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你需要新烤漆，朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.30,0:46:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用，谢了 要不要有机燃料啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.40,0:46:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个畸形玩意？ 不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.80,0:46:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他工作让我都渴了，还有谁要喝饮料的啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.30,0:46:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要，芙蓉
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.00,0:46:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在实施特殊饮食法
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.50,0:46:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在是速度和空气力学的精密仪器
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.70,0:46:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开车跟你修路一样
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.00,0:46:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着瞧，你等着瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.20,0:46:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！我恨死了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.60,0:46:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,音乐，蛮悦耳的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.40,0:46:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这个主意还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.00,0:46:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,油车水镇，快乐的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.80,0:46:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，贝西，你觉得这样好笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.20,0:46:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了！我居然跟贝西说话 我跟贝茜说话
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.30,0:47:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.70,0:47:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安，莎莉
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.40,0:47:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你看闪电麦坤 刚铺好的这条漂亮的新马路
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.70,0:47:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，好漂亮哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.90,0:47:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…雷蒙，我好久没看到你这么贴地
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.20,0:47:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好久没看到这么样的马路
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.80,0:47:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么溜达溜达吧，宝贝 街头漫步
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.00,0:47:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！好美，太美了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.30,0:47:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇诺，你看 就像天使铺的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.00,0:47:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子，我告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.30,0:47:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说天上的路都没这么平
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.20,0:47:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩大夫，你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.00,0:47:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们啊，早就该把他丢进仙人掌堆里了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.00,0:47:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没完成呢，还有很长一段路
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.50,0:47:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇诺，你看卡布
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.10,0:48:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这实在太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.90,0:48:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来好好玩哦 拖线，我先预约，下一个是我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.40,0:48:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，卡布，新马路让你的店 看起来像垃圾场
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.40,0:48:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女人嘴巴真毒
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.10,0:48:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说的对！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.00,0:48:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇诺
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.60,0:48:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小子居然做得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.60,0:48:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，慢着，他跑哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.80,0:48:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长，他是不是又跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.60,0:48:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不，他半夜里啊 柏油用完了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.00,0:48:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,问我他可不可以到这个地方来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.40,0:48:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只想把那个弯给搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.90,0:48:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不…啊…可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.20,0:48:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在每个赛车场上过弯都无懈可击
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.40,0:48:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会栽在那个弯上？ 警长，我看你去芙蓉那儿加点油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.00,0:49:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来看着他
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.50,0:49:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了，大夫 我也觉得我的油快没了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.70,0:49:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是柏油路，孩子，这是土
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.30,0:49:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，你来做什么？幸灾乐祸？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.10,0:49:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有三轮刹车，所以你得提前快转
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.50,0:49:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,甩尾，然后用油门操控
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.10,0:49:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度太快的话，你会冲出道路的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.20,0:49:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是法官、医生， 还是个赛车专家
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.40,0:49:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单的说
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.10,0:49:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你向左急转的话，会发现自己滑向右边
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.30,0:49:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！对，很有道理 前轮往右左转，是啊，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.80,0:49:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我该说“不谢”
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.70,0:49:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为按照你的逻辑 不谢的意思就是谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.10,0:50:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么古董老爷车，真是白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.10,0:50:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,前轮往右左转
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.30,0:50:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.10,0:50:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,前轮往右左转，你猜怎么样？我试了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.40,0:50:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果你知道吗？ 发生了怪事，我往右转
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.60,0:50:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再继续跟自己说话，大家会以为你疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.10,0:50:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的忠告 什么？我不是跟你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.90,0:50:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！奇诺，好漂亮 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.50,0:50:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说好漂亮 哦…你喜欢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.50,0:51:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.60,0:51:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖线！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.30,0:51:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天晚上你看守囚犯
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.50,0:51:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么又是我 等一下，万一他又想逃跑呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.90,0:51:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让他把油耗光，再把他拖回来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.80,0:51:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是要盯着他 遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.10,0:51:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被困在这儿铺这条差劲的路
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.80,0:51:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,“路霸”却在加州跟戴诺可打屁
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.40,0:51:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的戴诺可，哦，谁碰我？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.80,0:51:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的轮胎漏气，奇诺会修
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.10,0:51:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把马路铺得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.20,0:51:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到我店里来 卡布好好照料你
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.00,0:51:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你不是法拉利
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.70,0:51:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你买四个轮胎 我送你一个备胎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.80,0:51:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全免费！ 卡布，我所有的轮胎都是免费的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.80,0:51:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的风格
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.40,0:51:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很会杀价，好吧 卡布再给一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.00,0:51:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你买一个轮胎 我送你三个不用钱
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.50,0:51:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，你瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.30,0:51:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷蒙，雷蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.50,0:52:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么卡布再给你一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.60,0:52:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不… 不必了，不用，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.70,0:52:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 这可是最后一次机会了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.40,0:52:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你买一个轮胎 我免费送你七个雪地轮胎！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.20,0:52:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有兴趣来找我，你知道我在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.70,0:52:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！停！不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.20,0:52:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小红，你漏了一个地方 就在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.10,0:52:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…那…那车盖那儿 不
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.20,0:52:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.60,0:52:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.20,0:52:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了，小红
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.80,0:52:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是做什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.10,0:52:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不要住三角锥啊 啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.40,0:52:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要住就得干干净净的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.90,0:52:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看这蛮荒地带，还是有一定水准的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.50,0:52:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我…我不懂 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.30,0:52:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想说… 谢谢你把路铺得这么好
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.00,0:52:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想让你跟我住 不是跟我住
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.30,0:52:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是住那儿，不是跟我住那儿 是你住你自己的三角锥
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.00,0:53:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我住我的三角锥，就在… 慢点，慢点，你是在对我示好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.90,0:53:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想留在肮脏的拖吊场 随你便
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.40,0:53:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解你们这种罪犯类型 不不不…没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.70,0:53:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，三角锥 它才重新整修过
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.00,0:53:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，有趣的笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.60,0:53:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅馆房间是三角锥 通常车辆应该要避免的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.80,0:53:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是现在却给我们住，真好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.60,0:53:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都瞒不过你，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.80,0:53:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,要的话，住一号
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.90,0:53:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，我是不是看到你后面有细纹刺青？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.70,0:53:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，那只是…哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.40,0:53:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！你看见了？我要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.80,0:53:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要…对，我走喽
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.20,0:53:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？ 我以前认识一个女孩朵玲
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.80,0:53:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很漂亮的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.40,0:54:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来就像跑车，不过她是卡车
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.80,0:54:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我常故意撞她，找机会跟她说话
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.40,0:54:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖线，你在说什么啊？ 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.90,0:54:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，我知道我们今天晚上，可以做什么 因为我负责看守你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.10,0:54:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我得先铺完这条路 然后我就要离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.30,0:54:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系，你这个过弯失败先生
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.00,0:54:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正这件事情你可能做不来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.40,0:54:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！慢着，客气点，拖线
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.20,0:54:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你在跟谁说话？ 我是闪电麦坤
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.30,0:54:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无所不能
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.70,0:54:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖线，我不要做这种事 哦！走嘛，你一定会喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.80,0:54:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看牵引机出糗 这实在是太可笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.40,0:54:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，听着
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.90,0:54:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说走就走 别让牛大叔抓到你，走！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.90,0:54:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！谁？谁是牛大叔？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.80,0:54:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖线！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.80,0:54:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，拖线！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.00,0:54:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我教你怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.50,0:54:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷偷溜到他们前面，然后叭
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.90,0:55:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来就看他们了，看着
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.50,0:55:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓，牵引机太笨了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.70,0:55:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你，小老弟 没有比这个更爽的了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.60,0:55:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，你活在天堂里，拖线
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.40,0:55:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你是谁，那个就是好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.50,0:55:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你了，老弟
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.30,0:55:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖线，我不能 我连喇叭都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.80,0:55:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆小鬼 我不是胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.20,0:55:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，停，停 好了，我想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.00,0:56:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.00,0:57:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑！跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.80,0:57:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了！小心！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.60,0:57:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑！他要追上你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.70,0:57:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,顾客
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.30,0:57:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.30,0:57:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我们可以去找鬼火
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.20,0:58:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等不及了，拖线 是啊，小老弟
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.00,0:58:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天啊！你得承认那真的好好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.20,0:58:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…是啊，是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.20,0:58:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，我最好还是带你回拖吊场
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.30,0:58:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？ 莎莉要让我住汽车旅馆
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.60,0:58:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…去那里谈情说爱，是吧？ 哦，不，不…爱说笑
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.00,0:58:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说她受不了我 老实说，我也不喜欢她
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.40,0:58:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，大概是吧 嘿，你看，莎莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.30,0:58:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪？在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.10,0:58:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱上莎莉小姐了 不，我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.80,0:58:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有，你有 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.00,0:58:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.30,0:58:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱上了莎莉 拜托，真幼稚
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.80,0:58:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖线，成熟点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.50,0:58:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱她，你爱她 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.40,0:58:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱她！你爱她，爱她！ 好吧，好…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.60,0:58:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖线，拖线，够了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.20,0:58:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样好吗？ 别怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.20,0:58:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样倒着开，让我紧张 你会撞到什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.60,0:58:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞到？我可是全世界的倒车冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.60,0:59:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你注意看好了，情圣
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.80,0:59:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？小心、小心
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.50,0:59:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖线、拖线
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.10,0:59:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖线
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.70,0:59:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！冷静一点，拖线
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.90,0:59:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.60,0:59:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不必看路就可以走得很稳
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.10,0:59:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？还不赖吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.90,0:59:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！你实在帅呆了 你怎么做的？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.10,0:59:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,全靠我的后视镜 我帮你装，还可以教你怎么用
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.10,0:59:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，也许我赛车时用得着
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.50,0:59:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能告诉我这场赛车为什么对你那么重要？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.50,1:00:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是普通赛车 我们说的是活塞杯赛车
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.30,1:00:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它也是我梦寐以求的赛车
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.70,1:00:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将会是历史上第一个赢得 活塞杯的菜鸟
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.80,1:00:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候我就会有很多新的赞助厂商
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.40,1:00:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,专用的直升机
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.20,1:00:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必再代言保险杆药膏 不必理会生锈的旧车
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.50,1:00:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,生锈的旧车哪里不好？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.40,1:00:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！我不是说你 我是说别的旧车，你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.10,1:00:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你，我喜欢你 没关系，朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.70,1:00:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…你认为有一天 我也可以搭乘那种直升机吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.40,1:00:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我一直梦想 能够搭乘那种豪华的直升机
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.10,1:00:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以，可以，当然可以 真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.00,1:00:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，你要什么都行
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.00,1:00:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道 我就知道我没有选错
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.80,1:00:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,选什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.60,1:00:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.90,1:00:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早见了，小老弟
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.80,1:01:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤和莎莉躲在树底下
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.30,1:01:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,两部车子在玩亲亲
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.30,1:01:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号、一号、一号
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.70,1:01:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！挺不错的 嘿！贴纸王
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.70,1:01:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你吓了我一跳
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.40,1:01:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要小心点 我被你被我吓一跳吓一跳
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.60,1:01:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实不是真的吓到 不，当然不是，不…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.80,1:01:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…只是… 只是我听到你跟拖线的谈话
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.60,1:01:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候？刚…刚才吗？ 你…你听到什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.40,1:01:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！是关于搭直升机兜风
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.90,1:01:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！对…对 他很喜欢这点子，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.70,1:01:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说真的？ 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.70,1:01:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他坐直升机 哦…谁知道？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.80,1:01:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总得先离开这个地方参加赛车
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.00,1:01:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道，拖线他信任你
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.50,1:01:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.00,1:02:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这什么意思？ 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.70,1:02:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是“哦！好吧” 还是“哦！好吧”，或是“嗯…好吧”
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.50,1:02:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，我累了，今天实在是有一点忙
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.90,1:02:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！好吧，晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.40,1:02:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.90,1:02:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.20,1:02:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你让我住在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.50,1:02:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴能离开拖吊场 而且这里…很棒
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.40,1:02:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚整修过，是吗？ 是
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.90,1:02:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.60,1:03:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你关掉那个破音乐 好不好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.40,1:03:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是吉他教父罕醉克斯经典作
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.50,1:03:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.20,1:03:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定得离开这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.10,1:03:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你有没有看到警长 哦，我的天
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.10,1:03:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你做什么？ 看得过瘾吗，都市小子？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.40,1:03:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我只是需要警长给我今天的汽油配给
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.00,1:03:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,去芙蓉那儿等他，你快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.20,1:03:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我三天前就想离开这里了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.90,1:03:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你大饱眼福了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.00,1:04:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩大夫
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.90,1:04:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该整理一下车库了 老哥，拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.50,1:04:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.40,1:04:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有活塞奖杯？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.30,1:04:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.40,1:04:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,三座活塞奖杯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.80,1:05:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,牌子是写着禁止入内
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.60,1:05:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有三座活塞奖杯，你怎么会有…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.30,1:05:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道你不会开车 没想到你也不识字
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.40,1:05:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是韩森黄蜂！ 我不是说过了吗？到芙蓉那儿去等
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.50,1:05:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了，我以前居然没有想到
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.10,1:05:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是出神入化的韩森黄蜂！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.90,1:05:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经是单季最多胜利的纪录保持人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.30,1:05:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，你要教我，教我你的技巧，拜托 我已经试过了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.50,1:05:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说你三次拿到冠军 看看那些奖杯
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.30,1:05:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看，我只看见一堆空杯子
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.00,1:05:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？做做汽车瑜伽 可以增加你的马力跟扭力
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.30,1:05:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，好了，去洗车吧，嬉皮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.20,1:05:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！快看看我老公 呼！真亮眼
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.50,1:05:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄色，宝贝 你帅呆了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.30,1:05:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.40,1:05:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我的天！各位！ 你们知道韩大夫是有名的赛车吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.70,1:05:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩大夫？我们的韩大夫？ 不是可能
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.50,1:06:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不，我说的是真的！ 他是真正赛车界传奇
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.20,1:06:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是出神入化的韩森黄蜂
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.50,1:06:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,出神入化？ 我没见过他开车超过30公里
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.90,1:06:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你看过他赛车吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.00,1:06:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有，要是有就好，听说他非常行
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.70,1:06:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿了三座活塞奖杯 他拿杯子做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.60,1:06:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看这小子大概热昏头了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.00,1:06:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是吗？看他好红哦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.20,1:06:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要上一层新的防锈涂料
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.70,1:06:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你病了吗？小老弟 你的气色是有点苍白
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.50,1:06:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，他铁定需要啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.60,1:06:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿！你在干什么？ 没关系，警长，你可以信任我，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.20,1:06:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是相信你，可是我担心是他
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.90,1:06:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信任他
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.20,1:06:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去兜风 兜风？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.50,1:06:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，兜风
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.90,1:06:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你们大都市的赛车从来不兜风的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.10,1:06:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，我们不兜风
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.30,1:07:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，贴纸王，你来不来啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.20,1:07:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还以为他会逃跑 嘿！你相信吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.70,1:07:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他居然以为韩大夫是有名的赛车
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.20,1:07:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好笑了！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.20,1:07:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，你把我弄出来了 我们要去哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.70,1:07:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.10,1:09:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…这是什么地方啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.50,1:09:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮井
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.90,1:09:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经是原始公路上最受欢迎的一站
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.80,1:09:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.20,1:09:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，想想看
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.90,1:10:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看当时住在这里的情形
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.00,1:10:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真搞不懂你
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.60,1:10:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,保时捷怎么会沦落到这个地方？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.90,1:10:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,原因其实很简单，以前
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.20,1:10:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是洛杉矶的律师 过着纸醉金迷的生活
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.40,1:10:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！真的是这样吗？你很有钱吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.10,1:10:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？ 我只是想弄清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.20,1:10:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，好吧，那是我生活的方式
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.90,1:10:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.80,1:10:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总觉得…不快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.10,1:10:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，我是说…真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.20,1:10:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的，所以我离开加州
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.00,1:10:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直向前走，最后就在这儿抛锚
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.10,1:10:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩大夫把我修好，芙蓉收容我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.90,1:10:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是大家收容我，我就没有再离开
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.20,1:10:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，你知道吗？我了解
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.00,1:10:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要休息一下，让电池充充电
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.90,1:10:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是过了一阵子以后，你为什么不回去？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.60,1:11:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恋爱了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.10,1:11:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.60,1:11:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是名车？ 不是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.00,1:11:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱上了…这个地方
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.70,1:11:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！好美啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.30,1:11:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看，他们就这样开过去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.70,1:11:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不知道自己错过什么
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.00,1:11:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.80,1:11:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.20,1:11:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，40年前，下面的州际公路并不存在
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.20,1:11:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.30,1:11:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，那个时候
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.00,1:11:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,车辆走的是完全不同的路
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.20,1:11:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.60,1:12:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候的路，没有像州际公路这样穿过土地
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.00,1:12:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它顺着地形走，有起，有伏，有弯曲
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.70,1:12:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,早！ 早，天气真好
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.70,1:12:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,车辆行驶在那条路上，不是为了节省时间
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.50,1:12:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是在享受时光
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.10,1:12:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.60,1:12:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,公路避开我们的镇，只为了节省十分钟车程
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.20,1:14:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是能看到这里过去的盛况就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.90,1:14:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，这样的梦，我不知道做过多少次了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.70,1:14:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天，我们一定会想办法 让它恢复繁荣
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.50,1:14:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，谢谢你带我来兜风
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.20,1:14:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.10,1:14:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶尔轻松一下其实挺好的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.50,1:14:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.00,1:14:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，听着，听着
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.30,1:14:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人问起的话 我们是去砸信箱的，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.50,1:14:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.90,1:15:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是，油漆还没干…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.60,1:15:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不…别进店里去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.50,1:15:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，别吃我的轮胎，给你吃雪地轮胎
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.20,1:15:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖线 我没有去吓牵引机
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.60,1:15:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这些要命的牵引机是从哪来的？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.90,1:15:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停下来 嘿！各位
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.30,1:15:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一部往这边喽
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.20,1:15:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去追
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.90,1:15:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来，小牵引机，过来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.30,1:15:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，这才乖
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.60,1:15:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不…过来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.00,1:15:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.50,1:15:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该脱队，独自乱跑
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.20,1:16:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你换上旧赛车胎做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.10,1:16:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊，韩大夫，开车
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.90,1:17:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.50,1:17:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.80,1:17:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩大夫，等等
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.40,1:18:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快，慢郎中
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.70,1:18:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩大夫，等等 说真的，你的技术出神入化
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.00,1:18:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了，你可以走了 嘿，我说真的，你宝刀未老
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.40,1:18:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说你可以走了 拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.30,1:18:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是赛车 你是很老的赛车
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.30,1:18:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是在车盖底下，我们是一样的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.40,1:18:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不一样！你懂了吗？ 你给我走吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.60,1:18:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你这样的车 怎么会在高峰时期放弃呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.40,1:18:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我放弃？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.30,1:18:39.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（大车祸！ 韩森黄蜂 退出赛季）
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.40,1:18:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.70,1:18:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在1954年发生意外
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.10,1:18:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们放弃我
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.50,1:18:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我终于维修好 我以为会受到欢迎
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.10,1:18:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们怎么说？ 你过时了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.10,1:18:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就转而注意旁边的菜鸟
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.00,1:19:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍有雄心壮志
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.00,1:19:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,却没有机会表现了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.50,1:19:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留着那个提醒自己再也不回去
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.20,1:19:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是没有想到那个世界会…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.90,1:19:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,会在这儿找到我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.20,1:19:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是韩大夫，我不是他们 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.90,1:19:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.00,1:19:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你除了在乎你自己什么时候关心过别人？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.90,1:19:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要说出一次，我就收回我的话
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.30,1:19:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想也是
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.70,1:19:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的居民都很善良 彼此关怀照顾
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.10,1:19:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望他们依赖不值得依赖的人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.80,1:19:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你？你在这儿多久了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.90,1:19:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友连你是谁都不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.80,1:19:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁只关心自己啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.90,1:19:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,铺完那条路，你就可以走了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.90,1:20:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你，关掉那个破音乐
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.70,1:20:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊重点，这是经典音乐
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.60,1:20:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他完成了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.00,1:20:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定是趁我们睡觉的时候完成的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.30,1:20:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路顺风了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.40,1:20:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.90,1:21:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊！ 我们也不希望他错过那场赛车
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.40,1:21:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！警长，你在哭吗？ 哪有啊？我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.80,1:21:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我白天不必再分分秒秒地盯着他了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.80,1:21:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴他走了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.60,1:21:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小红怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.50,1:21:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！他是难过你离开这里 去参加你的重要比赛
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.00,1:21:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好拿到你梦想了一辈子的活塞奖杯
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.00,1:21:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,得到你说过的大厂商赞助
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.90,1:21:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有漂亮的直升机
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.10,1:21:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…你没有走！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.80,1:21:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你不会不说一声就走
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.70,1:21:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这做什么啊？你会错过比赛
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.50,1:21:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，我用警车护送你 我们会赶上的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.20,1:21:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，警长
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.50,1:21:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你知道我不能走
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.70,1:22:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.20,1:22:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定这些轮胎…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.10,1:22:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以送我一路到加州 维修？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.10,1:22:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，有谁知道卡布几点营业？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.50,1:22:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信啊！四个新轮胎！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.80,1:22:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电先生，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.50,1:22:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没想到！ 我们多年来的第一个顾客！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.70,1:22:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我充满了狂喜的泪水
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.30,1:22:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是我一生中最光荣的一天
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.30,1:22:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，好了，卡布 给我你店里最好的黑色轮胎
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.50,1:22:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.80,1:22:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道自己要什么 卡布知道你要什么
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.30,1:22:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑色的轮胎会和路面分不清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.70,1:22:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是这些
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.50,1:22:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,白色轮胎
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.40,1:22:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们说“看着我，我在这儿，爱我”
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.60,1:22:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，你是专家
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.50,1:22:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了…备胎
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.50,1:22:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了，奇诺
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.70,1:23:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡布说得没错吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.70,1:23:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…你说得对，比法拉利还棒
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.00,1:23:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.00,1:23:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！这有机燃料真棒，为什么以前没听说过
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.70,1:23:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个阴谋，朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.70,1:23:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,石油公司控制了政府
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.30,1:23:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都在骗我们耶，朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.60,1:23:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我要一箱
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.20,1:24:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,咔嚓
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.60,1:24:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来了！ 好了，大家，各就各位，快点
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.70,1:24:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,自然一点
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.50,1:24:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！莎莉
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.90,1:24:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧，怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.80,1:24:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位女士先生
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.00,1:24:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,请欢迎全新的闪电麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.60,1:24:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.70,1:24:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,油车水让我焕然一新
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.90,1:24:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.80,1:24:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,咔嚓
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.10,1:24:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定可以马上融入加州
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.50,1:24:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！你帮助了本镇所有的居民
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.70,1:24:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个除外
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.70,1:24:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，是不是已经很晚了？ 什么？他说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.80,1:24:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我再说一次，是不是已经很晚了？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.90,1:24:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很晚了，我们应该做什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.10,1:25:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们修了霓虹灯
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.30,1:25:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,街头漫步 对，没错，宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.60,1:25:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,重现往日光彩，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.00,1:25:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我想像的还美，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.80,1:26:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起兜风
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.30,1:26:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，我很乐意
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.70,1:26:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不！ 莉丝
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.30,1:26:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得我老伴第一次邀我跟他一起兜风
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.70,1:26:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，莎莉小姐，我可以跟你兜风吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.60,1:26:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以，拖线
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.40,1:26:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又问我一次，我说不行 他又再问我一次，我还是说不行 救我…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.90,1:26:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是啊，他是二汽缸引擎的老顽固了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.30,1:26:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于说…好吧，只兜一会儿哦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.20,1:26:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！ 谢了，拖线
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.40,1:26:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位，晚安了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.20,1:27:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊老伴，真希望你能看到这一切
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.50,1:27:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有没有看错啊？ 我不知道，芙蓉
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.40,1:27:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没有机会确认 可是我一定会问个清楚的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.20,1:27:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是啦，是那个
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.90,1:27:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有顾客？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.30,1:27:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,顾客上门了，很多顾客
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.00,1:27:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道怎么做 就像我们排练的那样
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.30,1:27:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是鬼火！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.00,1:27:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到麦坤了 我们找到麦坤了！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.50,1:27:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里，在哪里 麦坤，看这边
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.00,1:27:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，借过 你进了勒戒所是真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.80,1:27:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是得了忧郁症，麦坤 对不起，什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.00,1:27:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤装了白色轮胎 你的轮胎是不是提早报销了？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.90,1:27:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,贴纸王！麦坤！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.90,1:27:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电麦坤被你们监禁了吗？ 去！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.20,1:27:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是最好的朋友 不是我自夸
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.70,1:27:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我负责在他万一逃跑的时候缉捕他
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.00,1:27:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎莉！莎莉！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.60,1:27:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤，你还会参加活塞杯赛车吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.80,1:28:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,贴纸王？ 莎莉！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.60,1:28:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们闪电！ 贴纸王
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.00,1:28:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里！感谢制造商，你还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.60,1:28:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦大叔？ 你在这里，我真不敢相信！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.00,1:28:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是让我担心死了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.00,1:28:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉把你弄丢了，老板 我会补偿你
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.80,1:28:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦大叔，我真不敢相信你来了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.70,1:28:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是全世界最快的赛车吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.40,1:28:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哈威吗？ 是啊，他在后面
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.50,1:28:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们闪电，麦坤！ 退后，你们这些哈油的寄生虫
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.50,1:28:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,老嘿，以前那个麦坤呢？ 其实我这一面比较上相
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.10,1:28:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈威 为我们闪电！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.10,1:28:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈威？ 闪电呢？麦坤
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.10,1:28:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子，我在这儿 你好吗，哈威
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.90,1:28:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最大的客户从地球上消失了！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.60,1:28:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我好不好 哈威，我可以解释
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.90,1:28:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好极了！你无所不在，宝贝 收音机，电视，报纸
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.40,1:28:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种宣传是买不到的，你还需要我做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.50,1:28:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，对了，那只是一个比喻 我们有合约的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.10,1:28:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里？连我的GPS都找不到你
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.40,1:28:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在一个小镇，叫油车水
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.10,1:29:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道66号公路？它还在耶！ 是，很好，小子
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.30,1:29:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏时间结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.60,1:29:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,正当全世界都在找你的时候 戴诺可没有赞助对象
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.50,1:29:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只好赞助谁？ 路霸！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.20,1:29:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,答对了 事实上你看看电视正在播什么
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.90,1:29:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们看闪电！ 要看闪电？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.20,1:29:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要看闪电 喀其卡、喀其卡、喀其卡
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.90,1:29:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，那是我的词！ 你一定要立刻去加州！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.20,1:29:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就给我离开油车水 不然戴诺可就免谈了，听到没有？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.30,1:29:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等我一下，哈威
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.20,1:29:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不，等一下 嘿！你要去哪里啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.00,1:29:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,回拖车上，宝贝 小子，你要更大的拖车吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.40,1:29:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎莉，我…我要你知…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.80,1:29:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.40,1:29:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，谢谢你所做的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.40,1:29:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是一条路 不，不只是一条路
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.80,1:30:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，小子，我们得走了 哈威已经气炸了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.00,1:30:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是不马上上车，他就要开除我
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.30,1:30:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦大叔，再等一下 你该走了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.10,1:30:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，可是 祝你一切顺利
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.70,1:30:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你找到你的梦想
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.80,1:30:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪一下！ 莎莉
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.00,1:30:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎莉！ 嘿！闪电，闪闪看
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.30,1:30:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电，闪电，快点闪啊，麦坤
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.20,1:30:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，小子，快上车
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.10,1:30:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样，好极了，走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.50,1:30:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是闪亮的明星 你是超级明星
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.30,1:30:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正那里也不适合你
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.70,1:30:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…等…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.50,1:30:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你们看，麦坤上车要离开了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.80,1:30:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你是韩大夫吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.30,1:31:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 谢谢你通知我们
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.20,1:31:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你通知他们？ 这样对大家都好，莎莉
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.50,1:31:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是对大家好还是对你？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.10,1:31:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我居然没有跟他说再见
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.50,1:32:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位赛车迷 欢迎各位到场观看
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.90,1:32:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛车史上最轰动的一场比赛
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.30,1:32:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,活塞杯的三强鼎立赛
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.60,1:32:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃，洛杉矶国际赛车场这里
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.10,1:32:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,涌进了将近20万辆车到场观赛
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.80,1:32:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,入场券比限量供应的收藏品还要抢手呢！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.20,1:32:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,“冠军” “路霸”和“闪电”麦坤
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.80,1:32:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将角逐200圈，三抢一的冠军赛
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.20,1:33:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃，你知道我见过不少世面 可是我告诉你，老弟
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.50,1:33:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到我会看见这样的比赛 实在太刺激了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.60,1:33:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上，几乎全国都休息一天
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.00,1:33:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了看许多专家口中的世纪赛车
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.10,1:33:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！冠军，祝你比赛顺利
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.80,1:33:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直是我崇拜的偶像 谢了，小子，谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.00,1:33:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，答应我，小心一点，好吗？ 遵命
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.20,1:33:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.30,1:33:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道结果我就告诉你吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.90,1:33:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我百分之百夺冠！ 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.20,1:33:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说一遍，喀其喀其喀其咔
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.80,1:33:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你！没有车库通行证不准进去
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.80,1:33:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，没关系，闪电麦坤认识我
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.60,1:33:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克，今天是赛车的好日子，是不是？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.80,1:33:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也没错，安德瑞提先生 你早啊，佛瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.80,1:33:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛车英雄安德瑞提知道我的名字！ 你非让我进去不可了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.80,1:33:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉了，朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.20,1:33:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，开始了，专注，速度
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.20,1:34:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是速度
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.70,1:34:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.00,1:34:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位赢家，两位输家
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.20,1:34:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度 速度 速度 速度
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.90,1:34:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，闪电，准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.60,1:34:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是是是，我…我准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.70,1:34:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦大叔，谢谢你今天担任我的维修组
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.60,1:34:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必客气，小子，这是我该做的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.20,1:34:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟我的绰号叫汽油桶
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.70,1:34:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？ 哈…骗你的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.60,1:35:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼尔森，推近 16号机，准备
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.80,1:35:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了，闪电麦坤
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.10,1:35:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,失踪一个星期 然后在名不见经传的地方被发现
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.30,1:35:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小镇叫做油车水
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.70,1:35:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还装上白色轮胎
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.00,1:35:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,喀其卡、喀其卡、喀其卡
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.40,1:35:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你去哪了？麦坤 让我有点孤单
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.80,1:35:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何同伴，除了戴诺可的车
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.80,1:35:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，双胞胎 你知道双胞胎以前是你的粉丝
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.80,1:35:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是我的红粉 总之，听听她们怎么说
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.80,1:35:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.00,1:35:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位，开始赛车吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.40,1:36:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，你做得到
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.00,1:36:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，冠军，让我们以你为荣
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.30,1:36:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑了50圈，目前冠军还是稍稍领先
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.50,1:36:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，麦坤追上来了，他想从内侧超车
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.90,1:36:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！路霸给他吃了闭门羹
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.20,1:36:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天路霸可对他一点都不客气
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.60,1:36:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜他今天状况不太好
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.40,1:36:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他得重新追上去
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.10,1:36:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！麦坤在内场打转
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.20,1:36:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下我跟老家伙了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.90,1:36:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤今天逊呆了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.60,1:36:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，小子，你还好吗？ 我不知道，麦大叔
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.70,1:36:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我觉得不…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.20,1:36:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大老远跑来不是要看你放弃的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.20,1:37:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩大夫？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.40,1:37:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！小老弟，加油，我们来了 天啊！你们来了！我真不敢相信！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.10,1:37:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你需要总机械师 但没想到会这么糟
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.90,1:37:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说永远不回来
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.90,1:37:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在没选择啊，拖线没跟你说再见
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.60,1:37:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见！好了，我可以了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.40,1:37:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你开车像修马路一样好
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.00,1:37:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你闭着眼睛就能跑赢这场比赛
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.30,1:37:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,回跑道去吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.60,1:37:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,大鼻，我们有事要做了 奇诺、卡布
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.60,1:37:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是和专业维修员竞争
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.00,1:37:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作要快 让他们连怎么输的都不知道！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.20,1:37:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子，你可以打败他们
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.00,1:37:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到适合的节奏，追回落后的一圈
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.10,1:38:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看，那个？哇…对，是他！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.10,1:38:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是韩森黄蜂！ 鲍勃、达洛，韩森黄蜂回来了！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.90,1:38:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,达洛，麦坤给自己找到了维修组
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.60,1:38:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你看，他请了谁当总机械师
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.10,1:38:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，你们看，是韩森黄蜂！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.80,1:38:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，我的老天爷，真的是他 麦坤真有一套
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.80,1:38:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇，这是历史上的大事
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.90,1:38:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经五十几年没有人见过这位赛车传奇了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.90,1:38:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！韩大夫
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.40,1:38:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来看“收音机”上这家伙 他跟你长得一样耶
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.40,1:38:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤从内侧超过他们 可是他还落后将近一圈
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.30,1:38:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下60圈了，他能赶上吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.30,1:38:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制得很好，继续保持就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.90,1:38:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！小鬼！麦坤在哪找到你的？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.90,1:38:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些圆圆的东西叫轮胎 它们装在车子下面
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.70,1:39:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这样，奇诺！ 你会有机会的，你会有机会的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.80,1:39:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，小子想逞英雄，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.10,1:39:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试这个
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.50,1:39:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，就是这样，小子
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.00,1:39:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.30,1:39:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！帅呆喽！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.90,1:39:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我教他的！咔嚓！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.20,1:39:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤展现高超技巧，他追上领先者了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.30,1:39:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶！现在是
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.20,1:39:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,名副其实的三强鼎立，角逐第一
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.00,1:39:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小子真不是盖的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.10,1:40:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼！你休想
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.80,1:40:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩大夫，我暴胎了，我暴胎了！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.80,1:40:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能回到维修站？ 可以，应该可以
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.30,1:40:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄旗出现了，回来，小心别伤到底盘
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.60,1:40:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得让他快点回跑道上
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.80,1:40:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然落后太多，就甭想拿到冠军了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.80,1:40:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇诺，时候到了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.20,1:40:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鬼，你要洗他的挡风玻璃吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.40,1:40:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.90,1:40:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没见过这么快速的换胎
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.70,1:40:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他得在前导车之前回到跑道上
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.30,1:40:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,会很接近
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.70,1:40:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.20,1:40:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！他继续比赛喽！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.40,1:40:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好，奇诺
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.60,1:41:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,决胜时刻到了，现在进入最后一圈
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.70,1:41:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤紧追在领先者后面，好一个败部复活
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.20,1:41:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,199圈，现在已经到了关键的最后一圈
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.80,1:41:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,时候到了，小子
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.10,1:41:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你剩下四个弯，一次一个
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.70,1:41:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,深入弯内，把持住
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.20,1:41:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,去
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.30,1:41:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么容易
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.90,1:41:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤往内侧超车
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.50,1:41:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,路霸和冠军打滑了 我看麦坤要出局了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.20,1:41:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤救回来了 他回到跑道了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.00,1:41:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有凯迪拉克的优雅 有BMW的劲爆
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.00,1:42:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电麦坤将拿下活塞杯
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.00,1:42:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，你行的，你行的，贴纸王
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.70,1:42:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要再输给你了，老头
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.80,1:42:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.50,1:42:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了，宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.50,1:42:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想做什么啊？韩大夫
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.00,1:43:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么啊？小子
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.50,1:43:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,冠军应该跑完他最后一场赛车
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.90,1:43:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放弃了活塞奖杯，你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.90,1:43:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识了一个怪老头 他让我知道了一件事
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.60,1:43:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是个空杯子
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.80,1:43:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,达洛，最后一圈，在跑道上推车合法吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.40,1:43:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃，他不是在推他 他只是在帮助他加速
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.50,1:43:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，怎么啦？发生什么事啦
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.30,1:43:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是一流的赛车！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.50,1:43:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了，我的朋友 做的好，小老弟
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.70,1:44:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是充满了爱耶！你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.30,1:44:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我想吐，阿飞 他是我的偶像
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.90,1:44:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快呀，宝贝，快拿出来 拿出活塞奖杯
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.40,1:44:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,喀其卡！喀其卡！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.90,1:44:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！就是这样没错
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.90,1:44:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！为什么只有我一个在庆祝啊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.10,1:44:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小妞们呢？撒五彩碎纸啊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.40,1:44:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻一点！好吗？怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.10,1:44:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，快拍照 我要跟戴诺可签约了！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.50,1:44:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说一遍，喀其卡！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.70,1:44:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你们怎么了？噢！干吗生气啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.90,1:44:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！这是路霸时代的开始耶！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.90,1:44:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢了，闪电 不客气
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.80,1:44:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,冠军，你永远都是冠军
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.30,1:44:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是冠军！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.70,1:45:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以你为荣！ 恭喜你输了，小子
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.40,1:45:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很有义气，小子
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.20,1:45:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了，韩大夫
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.00,1:45:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，闪电
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.40,1:45:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过来跟我谈一谈，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.00,1:45:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子，你刚才表现得不俗
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.10,1:45:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想不想成为戴诺可的新代言人呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.50,1:45:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我输了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.10,1:45:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子，赛车并不只是为了赢而已
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.80,1:45:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他锈得太厉害了，当他走在街道上
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.60,1:45:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,秃鹰会绕着他盘旋
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.80,1:45:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，老德，可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.60,1:45:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是当初是“清锈”汽车 给了我蹿起的机会
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.90,1:45:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要继续帮他们代言
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.70,1:45:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，那我就尊重你的决定
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.80,1:45:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是如果我
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.10,1:45:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,能为你做任何事情，那就请你告诉我
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.00,1:46:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的慷慨，谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.00,1:46:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是有一件事
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.00,1:46:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你们！我在天上飞，我在飞！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.40,1:46:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比狂扫拖车公园的龙卷风还高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.00,1:46:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们该重新装潢了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.50,1:46:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好！闪电麦坤告诉我 这里有全世界
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.00,1:46:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的轮胎
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.00,1:46:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我和我的朋友 各三、四组轮胎，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.30,1:46:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇诺，有一辆真正的舒马赫法拉利在我店里
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.60,1:46:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的法拉利！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.00,1:46:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,打我，奇诺，打我的脸
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.20,1:46:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我这辈子最光荣的一天
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.90,1:46:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你的朋友他没有事
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.60,1:46:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你们俩很厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.20,1:47:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是刚好路过吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.80,1:47:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是我想住一阵子
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.20,1:47:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说这里又繁荣起来了 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.50,1:47:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有传闻说，活塞杯的一辆知名赛车
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.30,1:47:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要在这个小镇成立他的赛车总部
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.90,1:47:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？我们的镇要沉沦喽
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.80,1:47:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很想你，莎莉
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.30,1:47:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带给别人的感受连他们自己都无法理解
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.10,1:47:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦坤和莎莉躲在树底下
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.20,1:47:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,两部车子在…嗯…玩亲亲
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.20,1:47:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真会挑时间啊，拖线
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.20,1:47:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走了，拜拜，拜拜
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.30,1:47:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我最好的朋友，我能怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.80,1:48:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛一场吧，看我们谁先到芙蓉那里
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.80,1:48:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,换个花样，我们兜兜风吧
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.60,1:48:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…不要
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.90,1:48:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！咔嚓！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.00,1:49:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，请大家靠近一点
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.10,1:49:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在来到的地方呢 是博物馆的韩大夫区
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.90,1:49:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！酷毙了！单季那么多次胜利
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.00,1:49:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是真材实料，小子 韩森黄蜂是我的偶像
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.10,1:49:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，年轻人，韩大夫今天在吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.60,1:49:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，冠军夫人，韩大夫他好像出去兜风了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.00,1:49:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不是沙地赛车的料
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.60,1:49:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了，老头 我知道你所有的诡计
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.00,1:50:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩大夫！韩大夫！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.10,1:50:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会让你看穿的，菜鸟！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.90,1:50:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意！立正！ 跟柏油路告别吧，男士们
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.50,1:50:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我训练完了，泥巴会出现在 你们意想不到的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.00,1:50:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…我从没离开过马路 从现在起，这就要改变
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.10,1:50:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,向后转！出去跑三十公里！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.10,1:50:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快…快快快快快…快！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.20,1:50:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…沙子跑进我的钢圈里了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.60,1:50:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.70,1:50:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的车盖！我的车盖！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.90,1:50:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有20年没有看见它了！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.60,1:50:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常的合身，好不好看？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.30,1:51:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,又没了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.70,1:51:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是玩具车！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.30,1:51:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是可怜奇怪的小货车 我同情你，再见
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.50,1:51:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，是吗？一路顺风，你这个疯子
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.30,1:51:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很不想打断房车拉力赛 可是，他们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.10,1:51:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,庆生会客人在三点钟方向
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.50,1:51:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！谁配那小猪卡车的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.90,1:51:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你，他是个好演员
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.00,1:51:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被放逐了，天才 被困在这荒山野地，没有铁链
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.30,1:51:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是大眼仔，阿布汽车有麻烦 她需要我们帮助
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.10,1:51:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本没听我说话呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.50,1:51:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到喜马拉雅山！甜筒？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.40,1:51:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个学人铲雪机真是喜剧泰斗
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.60,1:51:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点进去！快快快！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.70,1:51:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,马戏团车？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.20,1:52:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么会是马戏团车
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.70,1:52:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是全世界最烂的马戏团车
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.30,1:52:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会让我发大财
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.40,1:52:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.60,1:52:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不断重复用同样的演员
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.10,1:52:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪门子的小成本电影？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.50,1:55:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，看在克莱斯勒份上 我们可不可以找辆车问一下路？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.30,1:55:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！快到匝道了！ 我知道！我感觉得到！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK Here we go。Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Speed。I am speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.60,0:00:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,One winner，42 losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I eat losers for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，maybe I should have had breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:01:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,A little breck-y could be good for me。No，no，no，stay focused。Speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm faster than fast。Quicker than quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.40,0:01:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am lightning！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.20,0:01:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Lightning！You ready？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.10,0:01:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah。Lightning's ready
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ka-chow！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get your antenna balls here！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，Lightnin'！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.60,0:02:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoo！You got that right，slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome back to the Dinoco 400.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.50,0:03:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Bob Cutlass，here with my good friend，Darrell Cartrip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.30,0:03:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're midway through what may be an historic day for racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bob，my oil pressure's through the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,If this gets more exciting，they're gonna have to tow me outta the booth！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，Darrell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three cars are tied for the season points lead，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.90,0:03:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,heading into the final race of the season.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the winner of this race will win the season title and the Piston Cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.90,0:03:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does The King，Strip Weathers，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.70,0:03:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,have one more victory in him before retirement？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's been Dinoco's golden boy for years！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can he win them one last Piston Cup？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:04:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，as always，in the second place spot we find Chick Hicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.80,0:04:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's been chasing that tailfin his entire career.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chick thought this was his year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.40,0:04:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,His chance to finally emerge from The King's shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,But the last thing he expected was Lightning McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.30,0:04:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I don't think anybody expected this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.50,0:04:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The rookie sensation came into the season unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.80,0:04:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,But everyone knows him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.30,0:04:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will he be the first rookie to win a Piston Cup and land Dinoco？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,The legend，the runner-up，and the rookie！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.10,0:04:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three cars，one champion！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,No you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.40,0:04:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.40,0:04:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a ride！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.70,0:05:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go get 'em，McQueen！Go get 'em！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you，Lightning！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dinoco is all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.30,0:05:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trouble，turn three！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.30,0:05:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get through that，McQueen。Huge crash behind the leaders！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.40,0:05:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a second，Darrell。McQueen is in the wreckage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no way the rookie can make it through！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.80,0:05:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not in one piece，that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:05:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lightning！Oh！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at that！McQueen made it through！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,A spectacular move by Lightning McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！Ka-chow！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen！McQueen！McQueen！McQueen！McQueen！McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，McQueen！Ka-chow！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,While everyone heads into the pits，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen stays out to take the lead！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't take me out，coach。I can still race！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you think？A thing of beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen made it！What？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not pitting！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.00,0:06:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gotta get me out there！Let's go！Get me back out there！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.20,0:06:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen's not going into the pits！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.00,0:06:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,The rookie fired his crew chief。The third this season！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Says he likes working alone。Go，go！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like Chick got caught up in the pits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，after a stop like that，he's got a lot of ground to make up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get ready，boys，we're coming to the restart！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，come on，come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need tires now！Come on，let's go！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.70,0:07:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，no！No tires，just gas！What？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need tires，you idiot！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like it's gas-and-go's for McQueen today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.00,0:07:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。No tires again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a short-term gain，long-term loss，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.20,0:07:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,but it's workin' for him。He obviously knows somethin' we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it，Darrell。One lap to go and Lightning McQueen has a huge lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's got it in the bag。Call in the dogs and put out the fire！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna crown us a new champion！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Checkered flag，here I come！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！McQueen's blown a tire！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,And with only one turn to go！Can he make it？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You fool！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen's blown a tire！He's blown a tire！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，go，go！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.40,0:08:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's lost another tire！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.20,0:08:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,King and Chick come up fast！They're entering turn three！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.20,0:08:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't believe what I'm watching，Bob！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lightning McQueen is 100 feet from his Piston Cup！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,The King and Chick rounding turn four.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Down the stretch they come！And it's，and it's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.60,0:09:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's too close to call！Too close！I don't believe it！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lightning！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.10,0:09:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,The most spectacular，amazing I don't believe it！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.20,0:09:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,unequivocally，unbelievable ending in the history of the world！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we don't know who won！Look at that！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.50,0:09:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's very close to call。Can we play that again？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，no cameras！Get outta here！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're here in Victory Lane，awaiting the results.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen，that was a risky move，not taking tires.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me about it！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you sorry you didn't have a crew chief out there？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.80,0:09:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Kori。There's a lot more to racing than just winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.30,0:09:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，taking the race by a full lap Where's the entertainment in that？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wanted to give folks a little sizzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.20,0:09:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sizzle？Am I sorry I don't have a crew chief？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'm not。'Cause I'm a one-man show.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Oh，yeah，right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was a confident Lightning McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.30,0:09:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Live from Victory Lane，I'm Kori Turbowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.00,0:09:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get outta the shot。Yo，Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chuck，what are you doing？You're blockin' the camera！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone wants to see the bolt。What？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，back away。That's it！Come on，guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.30,0:10:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，team！Where are you going？We quit，Mr。One-Man Show！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，OK，leave。Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,How will I ever find anyone else who knows how to fill me up with gas？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Adios，Chuck！And my name is not Chuck！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Lightning！Yo！McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seriously，that was some pretty darn nice racin' out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.30,0:10:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,By me！Oh，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Zinger！Welcome to the Chick era，baby！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.20,0:10:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Piston Cup It's mine，dude。It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，fellas，how do you think I'd look in Dinoco blue？Dinoco blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,In your dreams，Thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，right。Thunder？What's he talkin' about，「Thunder」？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，'cause thunder always comes after lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ka-ping！Ka-pow！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who knew about the thunder thing？I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was one close finish。You sure made Dinoco proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，King.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，Tex，you've been good to me all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the least I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever happens，you're a winner to me，you old daddy rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.30,0:11:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，dear。Wouldn't be nothing without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Mia。I'm Tia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're，like，your biggest fans！Ka-chow！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love being me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.60,0:11:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，girls，that's it。We love you，Lightning！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.70,0:11:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，buddy。You're one gutsy racer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，hey，Mr。The King.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got more talent in one lug nut
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,than a lot of cars has got in their whole body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？Oh，that But you're stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me？This ain't a one-man deal，kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need to wise up and get a good crew chief and a good team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.20,0:11:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ain't gonna win unless you got good folks behind you，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you let them do their job，like they should.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.70,0:12:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like I tell the boys at the shop A good team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Lightning！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.90,0:12:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you figure that out you just gonna be OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah，that That is spectacular advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.50,0:12:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Mr。The King.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,for the first time in Piston Cup history
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.50,0:12:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,A rookie has won the Piston Cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,we have a three-way tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，that must be really embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I wouldn't worry about it。Because I didn't do it！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.20,0:13:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Piston Cup officials have determined that a tiebreaker race
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.70,0:13:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,between the three leaders will be held in California in one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.10,0:13:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，thank you！Thanks to all of you out there！Thank you！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.50,0:13:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，first one to California gets Dinoco all to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，not me！No，you rock，and you know that！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah！Whoo！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yep！All right！Got it！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,「First one to California gets Dinoco all to himself.」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，we'll see who gets there first，Chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.20,0:13:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.40,0:13:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，kid！Congrats on the tie。I don't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go，Mack。Saddle up。What'd you do with my trailer？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.70,0:13:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I parked it at your sponsor's tent。What？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gotta make your personal appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.10,0:14:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。No！No，no，no，no！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，yes，yes！Lightning McQueen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I use Rust-eze Medicated Bumper Ointment，new rear end formula！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing soothes a rusty bumper like Rust-eze.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow！Look at that shine！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.50,0:14:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Use Rust-eze and you too can look like me！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.40,0:14:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ka-chow！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I met this car from Swampscott.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was so rusty he didn't even cast a shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You could see his dirty undercarriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hate rusty cars。This is not good for my image.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.30,0:14:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,They did give you your big break。Besides，it's in your contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，will you stop，please？Just go get hooked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Winter is a grand old time。Of this there are no ifs or buts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.80,0:14:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,But remember，all that salt and grime
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can rust your bolts and freeze your
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，look！There he is！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.40,0:14:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our almost champ！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get your rear end in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:14:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lightning McQueen，you are wicked fast！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.30,0:15:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,That race was a pisser！You were booking！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me a little room。You're my hero！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.60,0:15:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Fred.」 Fred，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.20,0:15:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,He knows my name。He knows my name！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looking good，Freddie！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.90,0:15:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks to you，Lightning，we had a banner year！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,We might clear enough to buy you some headlights.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.00,0:15:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You saying he doesn't have headlights？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.10,0:15:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I'm telling ya。They're stickers！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you know，racecars don't need headlights，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,because the track is always lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，well，so is my brother，but he still needs headlights.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen，Lightning McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Free Bird！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，the Rust-eze Medicated Bumper Ointment team
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.90,0:15:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,ran a great race today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,And remember，with a little Rust-eze
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,And an insane amount of luck，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,you too，can look like me。Ka-chow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.00,0:16:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，kid。We love ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.60,0:16:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we're looking forward to another great year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just like this year！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not on your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't drive like my brother！Yeah，don't drive like my brother！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,California，here we come！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dinoco，here we come！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh oh uh，I needed this。Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this Lightning McQueen，the world's fastest racing machine？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this Harv，the world's greatest agent？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it is such an honor to be your agent
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,that it almost hurts me to take ten percent of your winnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.50,0:18:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Merchandising。And ancillary rights in perpetuity。Anyway，what a race，champ！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.70,0:18:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't see it，but I heard you were great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.30,0:18:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，Harv.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，they're giving you 20 tickets for the tiebreaker thing in Cali.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll pass 'em on to your friends。Shoot me the names.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You let Harv rock it for you，baby。Right。Friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，there's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.90,0:18:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，I get it，Mr。Popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.70,0:18:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,So many you can't even narrow it down。Hey，when you get to town，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,you better make time for your best friend！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Break bread with your mishpocheh here！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,That'd be great！We should totally
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:19:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，I gotta jump，kid。Let me know how it goes。I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.60,0:19:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？A minivan？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.70,0:19:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，you're in the slow lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Lightning McQueen you're hauling here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just stopping off for a quick breather，kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Old Mack needs a rest。Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.00,0:19:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're driving all night till we get to California。We agreed to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,All night？May I remind you federal DOT regs state
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，I need to get there before Chick and hang with Dinoco.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,All those sleeping trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.40,0:19:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，kid，I don't know if I can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.20,0:19:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，sure you can，Mack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.70,0:19:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，it'll be easy。I'll stay up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.10,0:19:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,All night？All night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:21:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，yo，D.J。What up？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.10,0:21:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got ourselves a nodder.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.10,0:21:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pretty music.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.10,0:21:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo，Wingo！Lane change，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.70,0:21:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right back at ya！Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.10,0:21:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oops！I missed。You going on vacation？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.70,0:21:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，Snot Rod He's gonna blow！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.10,0:21:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gesundheit！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.30,0:21:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,One should never drive while drowsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.50,0:22:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mack！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.30,0:22:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mack！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.80,0:22:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mack！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.40,0:22:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Mack！Mack！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.90,0:22:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mack！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.50,0:22:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mack，wait for me！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.60,0:22:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mack！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.40,0:23:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mack！Mack！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.20,0:23:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mack！Mack
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,wait up！Mack.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.90,0:23:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mack！Mack！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.80,0:23:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？You're not Mack.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.00,0:23:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mack？I ain't no Mack！I'm a Peterbilt，for dang sake！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.20,0:23:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn on your lights，you moron！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.30,0:23:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mack The Interstate！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.50,0:23:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not in my town，you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.70,0:24:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.60,0:24:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，maybe he can help me！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.20,0:24:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's shooting at me！Why is he shooting at me？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.60,0:24:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I haven't gone this fast in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.00,0:24:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna blow a gasket or somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.90,0:24:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Serpentine！Serpentine，serpentine！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.30,0:24:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What in the blue blazes？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.00,0:24:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crazy hot-rodder.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.60,0:25:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm telling you，man，every third blink is slower.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.70,0:25:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sixties weren't good to you，were they？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.80,0:25:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？That's not the Interstate！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.40,0:25:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，no，no，no！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.40,0:26:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not the only one seeing this，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.90,0:26:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Incoming！Whoa，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.70,0:26:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.30,0:26:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,My tires！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.20,0:27:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fly away，Stanley。Be free！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.10,0:27:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy，you're in a heap of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.00,0:27:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're live at the Los Angeles International Speedway
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.80,0:27:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,as the first competitor，Lightning McQueen，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.40,0:27:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,is arriving at the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.80,0:27:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it true he's gonna pose for Cargirl？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.80,0:27:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's your strategy？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.00,0:27:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Did I forget to wipe my mud flaps？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.20,0:27:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen's driver arrived in California，but McQueen was missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.60,0:27:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen was reported missing。to race an unprecedented
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.70,0:27:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sponsor stated they have no idea where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.20,0:27:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope Lightning's OK。I'd hate to see anything bad happen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.80,0:27:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what's harder to find，McQueen or a chief who'll work with him！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.00,0:27:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lightning McQueen must be found at all costs！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.20,0:28:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're all asking the same question：Where is McQueen？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.10,0:28:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.30,0:28:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where am I？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.60,0:28:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mornin'，sleepin' beauty！Ah！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.80,0:28:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy，I was wonderin' when you was gonna wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.40,0:28:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take whatever you want！Just don't hurt me！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.40,0:28:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,A parking boot？Why do I have a parking boot on？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.10,0:28:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on here？Please！You're funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.20,0:28:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like you already。My name's Mater.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.70,0:28:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.80,0:28:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，like 「tuh-mater」，but without the 「tuh」.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.80,0:28:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's your name？You don't know my name？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.20,0:28:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I know your name。Is your name Mater too？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.70,0:28:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I need to get to California as fast as possible。Where am I？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.60,0:28:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you？Shoot！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.00,0:28:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're in Radiator Springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.60,0:28:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,The cutest little town in Carburetor County.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.10,0:28:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，great。Just great！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.00,0:29:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，if you think that's great，you should see the rest of the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.60,0:29:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I'd love to see the rest of the town！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.60,0:29:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,So if you could just open the gate，take this boot off，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.50,0:29:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,you and me，we go cruisin'，check out the local scene
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.30,0:29:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad-gum！How'd that be，Tuhmater？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.60,0:29:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cool！Mater！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.20,0:29:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did I tell you about talkin' to the accused？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.20,0:29:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,To not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.70,0:29:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，quit your yappin' and tow this delinquent road hazard to traffic court.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.20,0:29:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we'll talk later，Mater.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.40,0:29:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Later，Mater.」 That's funny！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.60,0:29:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Radiator Springs Traffic Court will come to order！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.40,0:29:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，you scratched my paint！I oughta take a blowtorch to you，man！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.00,0:29:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You broke-a the road！You a very bad car！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.40,0:29:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fascist！Commie！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.50,0:29:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Officer，talk to me，babe。How long is this gonna take？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.30,0:29:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotta get to California，pronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.10,0:29:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's your lawyer？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.40,0:29:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。Tahiti maybe。He's got a timeshare there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.70,0:29:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,When a defendant has no lawyer，the court will assign one to him。Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.90,0:29:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyone want to be his lawyer？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.30,0:30:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shoot，I'll do it，Sheriff！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.70,0:30:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,All rise！The Honorable Doc Hudson presiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.80,0:30:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Show-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.00,0:30:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,May Doc have mercy on your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.40,0:30:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.70,0:30:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wanna know who's responsible for wreckin' my town，Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.90,0:30:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want his hood on a platter！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.80,0:30:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put him in jail till he rots！No，check that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.60,0:30:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put him in jail till the jail rots on top of him，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.40,0:30:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,and then I'm gonna move him to a new jail and let that jail rot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.20,0:30:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.70,0:30:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Throw him out of here，Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.70,0:30:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want him out of my courtroom。I want him out of our town！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.20,0:30:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Case dismissed。Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.80,0:30:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy，I'm purty good at this lawyerin' stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.20,0:30:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late，Your Honor！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.70,0:30:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holy Porsche！She's gotta be from my attorney's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.70,0:30:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，thanks for comin'，but we're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.30,0:30:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's letting me go。He's letting you go？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.80,0:30:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，your job's pretty easy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.80,0:30:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,All you have to do now is stand there and let me look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.00,0:31:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，I'm gonna cut to the chase。Me，you，dinner。Pi-cha-kow！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.00,0:31:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the？Ow！Oh！Ka-chow！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.70,0:31:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please！I know。I get that reaction a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.90,0:31:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I create feelings in others that they themselves don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.20,0:31:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I'm sorry。Did I scare you？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.70,0:31:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,A little bit，but I'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.80,0:31:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK。I'm gonna go talk to the judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.60,0:31:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do what you gotta do，baby。But listen。Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.30,0:31:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Folks around here are not firing on all cylinders，if you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.10,0:31:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ka-ching！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.40,0:31:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.50,0:31:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey there，Mater。Howdy，Sally.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.30,0:31:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，folks！Good morning！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.30,0:31:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know her？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.40,0:31:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's the town attorney and my fiancee.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.40,0:31:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.50,0:31:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nah，I'm just kiddin'。She just likes me for my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.60,0:31:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You look great。You do something different with your side view mirrors？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.50,0:31:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you want，Sally？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.30,0:31:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，make this guy fix the road。The town needs this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.70,0:31:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I know his type。Racecar.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.90,0:32:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the last thing this town needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.10,0:32:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，I didn't want to have to do this，Doc，but you leave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.70,0:32:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fellow citizens，you're all aware of our town's proud history.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.70,0:32:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here she goes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.20,0:32:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Radiator Springs，the glorious jewel
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.90,0:32:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,strung on the necklace of Route 66，the mother road！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.60,0:32:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is our job and our pleasure to take care of the travelers
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.50,0:32:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,on our stretch of that road。Travelers？What travelers？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.60,0:32:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.80,0:32:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,But how，I ask you，are we to care for those travelers
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.20,0:32:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,if there is no road for them to drive on？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.60,0:32:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luigi，what do you have at your store？Tires.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.50,0:32:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if no one can get to you？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.10,0:32:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I won't sell any tires。I will lose everything！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.50,0:32:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Flo，what do you have at your store？I have gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.40,0:32:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lotsa gas！OK boys，stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.90,0:32:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，Flo，what'll happen if no one can come to your station to buy gas？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.50,0:32:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll go outta business and we'll have to leave town.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.00,0:32:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's gonna happen if Flo leaves town and closes her station？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.20,0:33:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Without gas，we're done for！What？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.90,0:33:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you think the car responsible should fix our road？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.80,0:33:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only guy strong enough to fix that road is Big Al！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.10,0:33:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lizzie，Big Al left like，15 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.40,0:33:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then why are you bringing him up，you lemon？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.50,0:33:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，he can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.60,0:33:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's got the horsepower。So，what do you want him to do？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.40,0:33:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fix the road！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.00,0:33:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because we are a town worth fixing！Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.90,0:33:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Order in the court！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.90,0:33:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seems like my mind has been changed for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.70,0:33:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！No！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.90,0:33:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I am so not taking you to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.40,0:33:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's OK，Stickers。You can take Bessie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.50,0:33:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，you get to work with Bessie！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.30,0:33:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd give my left two lug nuts for somethin' like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.00,0:33:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bessie？Who's Bessie？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.90,0:33:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,This here is Bessie，finest road-pavin' machine ever built.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.90,0:33:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm hereby sentencing you to community service.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.00,0:33:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna fix the road under my supervision.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.80,0:34:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？This place is crazy！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.20,0:34:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know this may be a bad time right now，
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.50,0:34:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,but you owe me $32，000 in legal fees.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.50,0:34:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.60,0:34:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna hitch you up to Bessie，and you're gonna pull her nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.20,0:34:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.90,0:34:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You start there where the road begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.90,0:34:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You finish down there where the road ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.90,0:34:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holy shoot！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.70,0:34:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，whoa，whoa！How long is this gonna take？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.20,0:34:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，fella does it right，should take him about five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.80,0:34:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Five days？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.10,0:34:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I should be in California schmoozing Dinoco right now！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.10,0:34:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then if I were you，I'd quit yappin' and start workin'！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.10,0:34:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hook him up，Mater。Okay-dokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.70,0:34:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freedom！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.20,0:34:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe I should've hooked him up to Bessie
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.50,0:35:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,and then then took the boot off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.40,0:35:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goodbye，Radiator Springs，and goodbye，Bessie！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.50,0:35:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,California，here I come！Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.70,0:35:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，feel that wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.20,0:35:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.30,0:35:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，no，no。Outta gas？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.70,0:35:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,How can I be outta gas？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.70,0:35:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy，we ain't as dumb as you think we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.80,0:35:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,But how did，how did you？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.20,0:35:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We siphoned your gas while you were passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.60,0:35:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ka-chow。Ow，ow，ow，ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.90,0:35:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gentlemen。Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.30,0:35:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.50,0:35:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why here？Sono sempre stati qui.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.80,0:35:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,They were better before。Stai sempre a parlare.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.40,0:36:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guido！Red，can you move over？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.40,0:36:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to get a look at that sexy hot rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.30,0:36:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I used to be a purty good whistler.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.20,0:36:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't do it now，of course，on account of sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.00,0:36:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I get fluid built up in my engine block，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.90,0:36:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,but Doc said he's gonna fix it。He can fix about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.40,0:36:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why we made him the judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.80,0:36:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy，you shoulda heard me on Giddy-up，Oom Papa Mow Mow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.00,0:36:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I'm not one to brag
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.40,0:36:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,but people come purty far to see me get low on the 「Mow-Mow」.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.30,0:36:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aw，man，that's just great！Hey，what's wrong？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.20,0:36:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,My lucky sticker's all dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.10,0:36:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，that ain't nothin'。I'll clean it for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.40,0:36:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.20,0:36:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,That won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.60,0:36:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Hey，big fella！Yeah，you in the red！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.00,0:36:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could use a little hose down。Help me wash this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.00,0:36:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's he goin'？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.10,0:36:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，he's a little bit shy，and he hates you for killin' his flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.60,0:36:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I shouldn't put up with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.20,0:37:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a precision instrument of speed and aerodynamics.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.10,0:37:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hurt your what？I'm a very famous racecar！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.40,0:37:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are a famous racecar？A real racecar？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.70,0:37:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I'm a real racecar。What do you think？Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.40,0:37:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have followed racing my entire life。My whole life！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.50,0:37:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then you know who I am。I'm Lightning McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.90,0:37:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lightning McQueen？Yes！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.00,0:37:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I must scream it to the world！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.10,0:37:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,My excitement from the top of someplace very high！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.40,0:37:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know many Ferraris？No，no，no，no，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.00,0:37:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,They race on the European circuit。I'm in the Piston Cup！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.70,0:37:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Luigi follow only the Ferraris.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that what I think it is？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.70,0:37:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.00,0:37:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Customers！Customers，everyone！Customers！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.50,0:37:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK！Customers？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.00,0:37:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Been a long time。Remember what we rehearsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.90,0:37:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make sure your 「Open，please come in」 signs are out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.50,0:38:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You all know what to do。All right，nobody panics。Here we go！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.10,0:38:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Van，I just don't see any on-ramp anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.80,0:38:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Minny，I know exactly where we are。Yeah，we're in the middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.30,0:38:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honey，please。Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.00,0:38:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome to Radiator Springs，gateway to Ornament Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.10,0:38:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Legendary for its service and hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.40,0:38:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,How can we help you？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.50,0:38:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't need anything，thank you。Ask for directions to the Interstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.70,0:38:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no need to ask for directions。I know where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.00,0:38:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,He did the same thing on our trip to Shakopee.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.50,0:38:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We were headed over there for the Crazy Days，and we
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.40,0:38:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK。Really。We're just peachy，OK？What you really need
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.50,0:38:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,is the sweet taste of my homemade，organic fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.60,0:38:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it doesn't agree with my tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.40,0:38:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just trying to find the Interstate。Good to see you，soldier！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.70,0:38:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on by Sarge's Surplus Hut for your government surplus needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.10,0:38:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honey，surplus！We have too much surplus.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.50,0:38:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do have a map over at the Cozy Cone Motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.90,0:38:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if you stay，we offer a free Lincoln Continental breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.10,0:38:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honey，she's got a map。I don't need a map！I have the GPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.90,0:39:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never need a map again，thank you。How 'bout somethin' to drink？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.50,0:39:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop at Flo's V-Eight Cafe。Finest fuel on Route 66.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.50,0:39:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No we just topped off.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.70,0:39:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if you need tires，stop by Luigi's Casa Della Tires，
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.60,0:39:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,home of the Leaning Tower of Tires.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.20,0:39:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're trying to find the Interstate。But you do need a paint job.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.60,0:39:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ramone will paint you up right。Hey，anything you want！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.80,0:39:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，like a flame job。No thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.20,0:39:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe ghost flames！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.60,0:39:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You like old school pinstripin'？Von Dutch style？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.20,0:39:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，honey，look。Von Dutch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.20,0:39:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，no。We're gonna be going now，OK？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.90,0:39:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,A little somethin' to remember us by，OK？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.30,0:39:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK！Come back soon，OK？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.50,0:39:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，you know where we are！Tell your friends！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.60,0:39:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK！Yes。You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.70,0:39:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks again，folks。Bye-bye now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.00,0:39:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Psst！Psst！Hey！Hey，hey，hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.20,0:39:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know how to get to the Interstate！Do ya？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.50,0:39:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Minny，no。Yeah，yeah，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.20,0:39:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，not really。But listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.70,0:40:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Lightning McQueen，famous racecar。I'm being held against my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.40,0:40:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you to call my team，so they can come rescue me
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.00,0:40:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,and get me to California in time for me to win the Piston Cup。Understand？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.80,0:40:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，no，no，no，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.20,0:40:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it's the truth！I'm telling you！You gotta help me！Don't leave me here！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.10,0:40:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm in hillbilly hell！My IQ's dropping by the second！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.30,0:40:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm becoming one of them！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.30,0:40:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，don't worry。They know where we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.50,0:40:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,They'll tell friends。You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.40,0:40:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll be back for our Hank Williams marathon
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.30,0:40:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's good。after a Piston Cup update.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.10,0:40:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still no sign of Lightning McQueen。Chick arrived in California
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.10,0:40:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,and today became the first car to spend practice time on the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.60,0:40:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's nice to get out here before the other competitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.80,0:40:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，get a head start。Gives me an edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.40,0:41:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，McQueen Eat your heart out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.10,0:41:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.50,0:41:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can go when this road is done。That's the deal，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.50,0:41:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what they done did said。OK。Outta my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.30,0:41:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got a road to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.30,0:41:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's done！Done？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.70,0:41:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh-huh。It's only been an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.00,0:41:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，I'm done。Look，I'm finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.40,0:41:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say thanks，and I'll be on my way。That's all you gotta say.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.90,0:41:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whee-hoo！I'm the first one on the new road！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.10,0:42:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,It rides purty smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.00,0:42:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It looks awful！Well，it matches the rest of the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.50,0:42:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.10,0:42:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.50,0:42:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Doc said when I finish，I could go。That was the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.80,0:42:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,The deal was you fix the road，not make it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.30,0:42:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，scrape it off！Start over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.90,0:42:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，look，grandpa，I'm not a bulldozer。I'm a racecar.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.10,0:42:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that right？Then why don't we just have a little race？Me and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.40,0:42:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Me and you。That a joke？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.30,0:42:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you win，you go and I fix the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.80,0:42:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I win，you do the road my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.50,0:42:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doc，what're you doin'？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.40,0:42:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't mean to be rude here，
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.30,0:42:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,but you probably go zero to sixty in，like，what？Three-point-five years？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.10,0:42:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then I reckon you ain't got nothin' to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.70,0:43:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what，old-timer？That's a wonderful idea。Let's race.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.10,0:43:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gentlemen，this will be a one-lap race.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.70,0:43:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will drive to Willy's Butte，go around Willy's Butte and come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.40,0:43:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,There will be no bumpin'，no cheatin'，no spittin'，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.90,0:43:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,no bitin'，no road rage，no maimin'，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.90,0:43:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,no oil slickin'，no pushin'，no shovin'，no backstabbin'，no road-hoggin'，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.10,0:43:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,and no lollygaggin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.00,0:43:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Speed。I'm speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.60,0:43:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Float like a Cadillac，sting like a Beemer.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.40,0:43:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,My friend Guido，he dream to give a real racecar a pit stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.90,0:43:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,The race is only one lap，guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.80,0:43:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uno lappo！Don't need any help.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.40,0:43:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I work solo mio。Fine。Race your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.50,0:43:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,No pit stoppo。Comprendo？OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.50,0:43:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gentlemen
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.10,0:43:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,start your engines！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.70,0:44:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hijole！Check that out！Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.20,0:44:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great idea，Doc。Now the road will never get done.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.60,0:44:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luigi？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.00,0:44:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,On your mark，get set
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.30,0:44:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uno for the money，due for the show，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.60,0:44:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,tre to get ready，and quattro to I can't believe it。Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.70,0:44:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doc the flag means go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.30,0:44:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember the fl Here we go。Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.70,0:44:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doc，what are you doing，man？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.50,0:44:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，dear。It would seem I'm off to a poor start.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.20,0:44:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，better late than never。Come on，Mater.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.40,0:44:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Might need a little help。Uh OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.80,0:44:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got your tow cable？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.40,0:44:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，yeah，I always got my tow cable。Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.60,0:44:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.70,0:45:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，no，no！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.60,0:45:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，man！Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.20,0:45:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Was that floatin' like a Cadillac or was that stingin' like a Beemer？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.30,0:45:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.70,0:45:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You drive like you fix roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.90,0:45:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lousy！Have fun fishin'，Mater.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.50,0:45:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm startin' to think he knowed you was gonna crash！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.50,0:45:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Mater。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.70,0:45:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can make a little turn on dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.70,0:45:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.20,0:45:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。And now I'm a day behind。I'm never gonna get outta here！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.80,0:45:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，ese！You need a new paint job，man！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.30,0:46:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，thank you。How 'bout some organic fuel？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.40,0:46:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,That freak juice？Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.80,0:46:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoo！Watchin' him is makin' me thirsty。Anybody else want somethin' to drink？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.30,0:46:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nah，not me，Flo.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.00,0:46:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm on one of them there special diets.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.50,0:46:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a precisional instrument of speed and aero-matics.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.70,0:46:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「You race like you fix roads.」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.00,0:46:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll show him。I will show him！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.20,0:46:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，great！I hate it！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.60,0:46:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hate，hate，hate，hate it！Music。Sweet music.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.40,0:46:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe this wasn't such a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.00,0:46:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Radiator Springs，a happy place！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.80,0:46:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，Bessie，you think that's funny？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.20,0:46:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great！I'm talking to Bessie now！I'm talking to Bessie！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.30,0:47:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.70,0:47:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mornin'，Sally！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.40,0:47:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，look at this here fancy new road that Lightnin' McQueen done just made！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.70,0:47:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！Uh，amazing！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.90,0:47:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Ramone！Mama ain't seen you that low in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.20,0:47:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I haven't seen a road like this in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.80,0:47:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，then let's cruise，baby。Low and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.00,0:47:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,E bellissima！It's beautiful！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.30,0:47:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guido，look，it's-a like it was paved by angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.00,0:47:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy，I tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.30,0:47:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I bet even the roads on the moon ain't this smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.20,0:47:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doc，look at this！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.00,0:47:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shoulda tossed him into the cactus a lot sooner，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.00,0:47:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，he ain't finished yet。Still got a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.50,0:47:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guido，look at Luigi！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.10,0:48:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is fantastico！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.90,0:48:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,That looks like fun！Mater，I got dibs，next turn！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.40,0:48:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Luigi，this new road makes your place look like a dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.40,0:48:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,That crazy old devil woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.10,0:48:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's right！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.00,0:48:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah！Guido！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.60,0:48:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh。That punk actually did a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.60,0:48:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，now where the heck is he？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.80,0:48:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sheriff！Is he makin' another run for it？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.60,0:48:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no。He ran outta asphalt in the middle of the night，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.00,0:48:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,and asked me if he could come down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.40,0:48:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,All he's tryin' to do is make that there turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.90,0:48:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，no！Oh，great.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.20,0:48:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perfect turns on every track I've ever raced on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.40,0:48:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sheriff，why don't you go get yourself a quart of oil at Flo's.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.00,0:49:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.50,0:49:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，thanks，Doc。I've been feelin' a quart low.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.70,0:49:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,This ain't asphalt，son。This is dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.30,0:49:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，great。What do you want？You here to gloat？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.10,0:49:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't have three-wheel brakes，so you got to pitch it hard，
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.50,0:49:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,break it loose and then just drive it with the throttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.10,0:49:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give it too much，you'll be outta the dirt and into the tulips.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.20,0:49:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you're a judge，a doctor and a racing expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.40,0:49:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll put it simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.10,0:49:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're goin' hard enough left，you'll find yourself turnin' right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.30,0:49:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh Right。That makes perfect sense。Turn right to go left！Yes！Thank you！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.80,0:49:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or should I say，「No，thank you」？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.70,0:49:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because in Opposite World，maybe that really means，「Thank you」！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.10,0:50:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crazy grandpa car。What an idiot！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.10,0:50:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn right to go left.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.30,0:50:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ow！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.10,0:50:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn right to go left。Guess what。I tried it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.40,0:50:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what？This crazy thing happened I went right！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.60,0:50:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You keep talkin' to yourself，people'll think you're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.10,0:50:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks for the tip。What？I wasn't talkin' to you！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.90,0:50:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Guido，e bellissimo！Che cosa？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.50,0:50:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,It looks great！This is great！Ti piace，eh？Si，si，bellissimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.50,0:51:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.60,0:51:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.30,0:51:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you to watch the prisoner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.50,0:51:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，dad-gum！Wait a minute。What if he tries to run again？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.90,0:51:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just let him run outta gas and tow him on back.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.80,0:51:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,But keep an eye on him。Yes，sir！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.10,0:51:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,While I'm stuck here paving this stinkin' road，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.80,0:51:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chick's in California schmoozing Dinoco.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.40,0:51:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,My Dinoco。Whoa，whoa，whoa！Who's touching me？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.80,0:51:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have a slow leak。Guido，he fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.10,0:51:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You make-a such a nice new road.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.20,0:51:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You come to my shop。Luigi take-a good care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.00,0:51:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even though you not a Ferrari.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.70,0:51:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You buy four tires，I give you a full-a size spare
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.80,0:51:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,absolutely free！Look，I get all my tires for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.80,0:51:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like your style，eh？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.40,0:51:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You drive the hard bargain。OK。Luigi make you a new deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.00,0:51:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You buy one tire，I give you three for free！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.50,0:51:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，would you look at that？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.30,0:51:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ramone，Ramone！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.50,0:52:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then Luigi make you a new new deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.60,0:52:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，no。Deal me out。Pass。No，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.70,0:52:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，no。No。This is it。My last offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.40,0:52:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You buy one tire，I give you seven-a snow tires for free！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.20,0:52:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Done。You interested，you call me。You know where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.70,0:52:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！Let me
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.20,0:52:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Red，you missed a spot。See it right there？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.10,0:52:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No！On the hood right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.20,0:52:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop，stop！That's cold！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.60,0:52:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help！Please！Stop！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.20,0:52:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.80,0:52:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was that for？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.10,0:52:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you want to stay at the Cozy Cone？Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.40,0:52:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you do，you gotta be clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.90,0:52:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause even in hillbilly hell we have standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.50,0:52:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What，I？I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.30,0:52:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought I'd say thank you for doin' a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.00,0:52:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I thought I'd let you stay with me。I mean，not with me！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.30,0:52:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,But there。Not with me there，but there in your own cozy cone.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.00,0:53:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'd be in my cone，and it's Wait。Wait，you're being nice to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.90,0:53:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you want to stay at the dirty impound，fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.40,0:53:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I understand you criminal types。No，no，no，no。That's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.70,0:53:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，the Cozy Cone。It's newly refurbished.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.00,0:53:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，it's like a clever little twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.60,0:53:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,The motel's made out of caution cones，which，of course，cars try to avoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.80,0:53:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,But now we're gonna stay in them。That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.60,0:53:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Figure that all out on your own，did you？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.80,0:53:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cone number one，if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.90,0:53:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，do I spy a little pinstriping tattoo back there？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.70,0:53:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh That's just a Oh！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.40,0:53:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you saw that？Yeah。Just gonna be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.80,0:53:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gonna Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.20,0:53:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I knew this girl Doreen.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.80,0:53:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good-lookin' girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.40,0:54:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looked just like a Jaguar，only she was a truck！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.80,0:54:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I used to crash into her，just so I could spoke to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.40,0:54:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you talking about？I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.90,0:54:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I know somethin' we can do tonight，'cause I'm in charge of watchin' you！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.10,0:54:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Mater，I gotta finish this road，and I have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.30,0:54:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，that's all right，Mr。I Can't Turn On Dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.00,0:54:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You probably couldn't handle it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.40,0:54:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，whoa，easy now，Mater.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.20,0:54:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know who you're talkin' to？This is Lightning McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.30,0:54:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can handle anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.70,0:54:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not doin' this。Come on。You'll love it！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.80,0:54:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tractor-tippin's fun。This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.40,0:54:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.90,0:54:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I say go，we go。But don't let Frank catch you。Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.90,0:54:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！Wait！Who's Frank？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.80,0:54:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.80,0:54:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，Mater！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.00,0:54:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，here's what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.50,0:54:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just sneak up in front of 'em，and then honk.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.90,0:55:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,And they do the rest。Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.50,0:55:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I swear，tractors is so dumb！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.70,0:55:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I tell you what，buddy，it don't get much better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.60,0:55:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yep，you're livin' the dream，Mater boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.40,0:55:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't care who you are，that's funny right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.50,0:55:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，your turn，bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.30,0:55:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater，I can't。I don't even have a horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.80,0:55:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Baby。I'm not a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.20,0:55:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine。Stop！Stop，OK？All right。I'll do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.00,0:56:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.00,0:57:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.80,0:57:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here he comes，look out！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.60,0:57:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run！He's gonna get ya！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.70,0:57:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Customers！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.30,0:57:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，no，no，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.30,0:57:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tomorrow night we can go look for the ghostlight！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.20,0:58:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't wait，Mater。Oh，yeah，I'm tellin' ya！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.00,0:58:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，boy，you gotta admit that was fun！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.20,0:58:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.20,0:58:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we better get you back to the impound lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.30,0:58:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，actually，Sally's gonna let me stay at the motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.60,0:58:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.00,0:58:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Besides，she can't stand me。And I don't like her，to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.40,0:58:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，you probably right。Hey，look，there's Miss Sally！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.30,0:58:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where，where？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.10,0:58:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're in love with Miss Sally。No，I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.80,0:58:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，you do。No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.00,0:58:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Way。Come on，look
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.30,0:58:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're in love with Miss Sally！Real mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.80,0:58:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're in love！Real grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.50,0:58:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You love her。You love her。Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.40,0:58:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You love her！You love her。You love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.60,0:58:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。OK。Mater，enough！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.20,0:58:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you stop that？Stop what？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.20,0:58:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Driving backwards。It's creeping me out。You're gonna wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.60,0:58:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wreck？Shoot！I'm the world's best backwards driver！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.60,0:59:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just watch this right here，lover boy。Wee-hee！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.80,0:59:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？Watch out！Look out！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.50,0:59:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater？Mater！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.10,0:59:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.70,0:59:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，take it easy，Mater！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.90,0:59:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.60,0:59:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No need to watch where I'm goin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.10,0:59:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just need to know where I've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.90,0:59:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，that was incredible！How'd you do that？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.10,0:59:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rearview mirrors。We'll get you some，and I'll teach you if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.10,0:59:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，maybe I'll use it in my big race.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.50,0:59:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's so important about this race of yours，anyway？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.50,1:00:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not just a race。We're talking about the Piston Cup！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.30,1:00:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been dreaming about it my whole life！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.70,1:00:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be the first rookie in history ever to win it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.80,1:00:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,And when I do，we're talkin' big new sponsor，
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.40,1:00:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,with private helicopters.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.20,1:00:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,No more medicated bumper ointment。No more rusty old cars.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.50,1:00:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong with rusty old cars？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.40,1:00:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I don't mean you，Mater。I mean other old cars。You know？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.10,1:00:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not like you。I like you。It's OK，buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.70,1:00:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，you think maybe one day I can get a ride in one of them helicopters？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.40,1:00:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，I've always wanted to ride in one of them fancy helicopters.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.10,1:00:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah，yeah，sure，sure。You mean it？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.00,1:00:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah。Anything you say.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.00,1:00:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew it。I knowed I made a good choice！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.80,1:00:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,In what？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.60,1:00:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,My best friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.90,1:00:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow，buddy！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.80,1:01:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen and Sally parked beneath a tree，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.30,1:01:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ki-s-somethin'-somethin'-somethin'-t！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.30,1:01:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Number one。Number one Ah，number one！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.70,1:01:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，this is nice。Hey，Stickers.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.70,1:01:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。You scared me。You gotta be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.40,1:01:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I scared myself scaring you scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.60,1:01:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，I wasn't like scared scared。No，of course not。No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.80,1:01:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was more I overheard you talkin' to Mater.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.60,1:01:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,When？Just now？What，what did，what did you hear？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.40,1:01:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something about a helicopter ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.90,1:01:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah。Yeah，he got a kick out of that，didn't he？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.70,1:01:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you mean it？What？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.70,1:01:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,That you'll get him a ride。Who knows？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.80,1:01:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,First things first。I gotta get outta here and make the race.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.00,1:01:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know Mater trusts you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.50,1:01:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.00,1:02:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you mean that？What？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.70,1:02:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was it just a 「Yeah，OK」，or 「Yeah OK」 or 「Yeah，o-OK」？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.50,1:02:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I'm exhausted。It's kinda been a long day.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.90,1:02:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，OK。G'night.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.40,1:02:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.90,1:02:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did you just say？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.20,1:02:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，thanks for lettin' me stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.50,1:02:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's nice to be out of the impound，and this is It's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.40,1:02:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newly refurbished，right？Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.90,1:02:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,G'night。Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.60,1:03:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you turn that disrespectful junk off？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.40,1:03:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Respect the classics，man。It's Hendrix！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.50,1:03:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.20,1:03:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotta get outta here！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.10,1:03:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，have you seen the Sheriff？Oh！Oh，my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.10,1:03:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，what are you doin'？Get a good peek，city boy？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.40,1:03:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just need my daily gas ration from the Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.00,1:03:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait for him at Flo's。Get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.20,1:03:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been trying to get outta here for three days！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.90,1:03:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hope you enjoyed the show！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.00,1:04:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，Doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.90,1:04:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time to clean out the garage，buddy，come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.50,1:04:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.40,1:04:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He has a Piston Cup？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.30,1:04:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.40,1:04:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three Piston Cups？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.80,1:05:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sign says stay out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.60,1:05:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have three Piston Cups。How could you have
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.30,1:05:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew you couldn't drive。I didn't know you couldn't read.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.40,1:05:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the Hudson Hornet！Wait at Flo's，like I told ya！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.50,1:05:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course。I can't believe I didn't see it before.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.10,1:05:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're The Fabulous Hudson Hornet！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.90,1:05:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You used to hold the record for most wins in a season。Oh，we gotta talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.30,1:05:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gotta show me your tricks。Please。I tried that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.50,1:05:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You won three times！Look at those trophies！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.30,1:05:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You look。All I see is a bunch of empty cups.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.00,1:05:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，some automotive yoga could really lower your RPM's，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.30,1:05:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，take a car wash，hippie.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.20,1:05:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，look at my husband，y'all！Whoo！That's your color！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.50,1:05:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yellow，baby。Mmm。You smokin' hot！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.30,1:05:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.40,1:05:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my gosh！Did you know Doc is a famous racecar？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.70,1:05:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doc？Our Doc？Not Doc Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.50,1:06:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，no，it's true！He's a real racing legend.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.20,1:06:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's The Fabulous Hudson Hornet！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.50,1:06:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fabulous？I never seen Doc drive more than 20 miles an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.90,1:06:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，have you ever seen him race？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.00,1:06:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，but I wish I could have。They say he was amazing！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.70,1:06:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,He won three Piston Cups！He did what in his cup？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.60,1:06:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think the heat's startin' to get to the boy！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.00,1:06:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I'll say！Look how red he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.20,1:06:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think he needs a new coat of poly，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.70,1:06:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you sick，buddy？You are lookin' peaked.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.50,1:06:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He needs a new coat of poly for sure！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.60,1:06:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！What are you doin'？It's OK。You can trust me，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.20,1:06:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I trust you，all right。It's him I'm worried about.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.90,1:06:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hmm I trust him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.20,1:06:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，let's take a drive。A drive？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.50,1:06:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，a drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.90,1:06:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you big city racecars ever just take a drive？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.10,1:06:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah No。No，we don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.30,1:07:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Stickers！You comin' or what？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.20,1:07:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you thought he was gonna run。Hey，can you believe it，man？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.70,1:07:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He actually thought Doc was a famous racecar！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.20,1:07:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's so too much！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.20,1:07:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，you got me out here。Where are we goin'？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.70,1:07:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.10,1:09:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow。What is this place？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.50,1:09:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wheel Well.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.90,1:09:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Used to be the most popular stop on the mother road.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.80,1:09:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,This place？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.20,1:09:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，imagine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.90,1:10:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，imagine what it must have been like to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.00,1:10:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I don't get you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.60,1:10:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,How does a Porsche wind up in a place like this？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.90,1:10:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it's really pretty simple。I was
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.20,1:10:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,an attorney in LA livin' life in the fast lane，and
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.40,1:10:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you were，were you？Were you rich？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.10,1:10:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Just clues to the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.20,1:10:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，OK。Well，that was my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.90,1:10:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you know what？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.80,1:10:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It never felt happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.10,1:10:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I mean really？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.20,1:10:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。So I left California.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.00,1:10:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just drove and drove and finally broke down right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.10,1:10:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doc fixed me up，Flo took me in.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.90,1:10:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，they all did。And I never left.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.20,1:10:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。You know，I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.00,1:10:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need a little R and R。Recharge the old batteries.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.90,1:10:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you know，after a while，why didn't you go back？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.60,1:11:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I fell in love.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.10,1:11:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.60,1:11:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Corvette？No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.00,1:11:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I fell in love with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.70,1:11:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa。Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.30,1:11:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，they're drivin' right by.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.70,1:11:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,They don't even know what they're missing！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.00,1:11:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it didn't used to be that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.80,1:11:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.20,1:11:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Forty years ago，that Interstate down there didn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.20,1:11:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.30,1:11:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Back then，
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.00,1:11:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,cars came across the country a whole different way.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.20,1:11:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you mean？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.60,1:12:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,The road didn't cut through the land like that Interstate.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.00,1:12:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It moved with the land，you know？It rose，it fell，it curved.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.70,1:12:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mornin'！Nice day，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.70,1:12:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cars didn't drive on it to make great time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.50,1:12:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,They drove on it to have a great time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.10,1:12:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，what happened？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.60,1:12:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,The town got bypassed just to save ten minutes of driving.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.20,1:14:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,How great would it have been to see this place in its heyday！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.90,1:14:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I can't tell you how many times I've dreamed of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.70,1:14:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,But one of these days we'll find a way to get it back on the map.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.50,1:14:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Hey，listen，thanks for the drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.20,1:14:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had a great time.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.10,1:14:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's kinda nice to slow down every once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.50,1:14:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.00,1:14:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，listen，listen！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.30,1:14:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,If anybody asks you，we was out smashin' mailboxes，OK？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.50,1:14:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wha what？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.90,1:15:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，man，the paint's still wet！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.60,1:15:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，no！Get out of the store！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.50,1:15:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Don't eat the radial！Here，take-a the snow tires.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.20,1:15:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mater！I wasn't tractor-tippin'！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.60,1:15:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then where did all these gol-durn tractors come from？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.90,1:15:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，boy！Hey！Hey，guys！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.30,1:15:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's one goin' this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.20,1:15:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.90,1:15:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come here，little tractor，come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.30,1:15:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，that's a good tractor.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.60,1:15:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，no，come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.00,1:15:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.50,1:15:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to go wandering off all alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.20,1:16:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doin' with those old racin' tires？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.10,1:16:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Doc，drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.90,1:17:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're amazing！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.50,1:17:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doin'？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.80,1:17:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doc，wait！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.40,1:18:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Giddup right in there！Come on，Rusty.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.70,1:18:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doc，hold it！Seriously，your driving's incredible！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.00,1:18:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wonderful。Now，go away。Hey，I mean it。You've still got it！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.40,1:18:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm askin' you to leave。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.30,1:18:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a racecar，you're a much older racecar，
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.30,1:18:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,but under the hood you and I are the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.40,1:18:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are not the same！Understand？Now，get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.60,1:18:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,How could a car like you quit at the top of your game？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.40,1:18:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think I quit？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.40,1:18:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.70,1:18:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your big wreck in '54.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.10,1:18:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,They quit on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.50,1:18:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I finally got put together，I went back expecting a big welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.10,1:18:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what they said？「You're history.」
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.10,1:18:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Moved right on to the next rookie standing in line.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.00,1:19:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,There was a lot left in me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.00,1:19:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never got a chance to show 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.50,1:19:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I keep that to remind me never to go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.20,1:19:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just never expected that that world would
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.90,1:19:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,would find me here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.20,1:19:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，look，Doc，I'm not them。Oh，yeah？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.90,1:19:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.00,1:19:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,When is the last time you cared about something except yourself，hot rod？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.90,1:19:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You name me one time and I will take it all back.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.30,1:19:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh-huh。I didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.70,1:19:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,These are good folk around here，who care about one another.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.10,1:19:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want 'em depending on someone they can't count on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.80,1:19:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，like you？You've been here how long
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.90,1:19:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,and your friends don't even know who you are？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.80,1:19:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's caring about only himself？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.90,1:19:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just finish that road and get outta here！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.90,1:20:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you turn that disrespectful junk off？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.70,1:20:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Respect the classics，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.60,1:20:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's done.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.00,1:20:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He must've finished it while we was all sleepin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.30,1:20:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good riddance.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.40,1:20:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gone？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.90,1:21:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we wouldn't want him to miss that race of his.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.40,1:21:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，dude，are you crying？No！I'm happy！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.80,1:21:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't have to watch him every second of the day anymore！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.80,1:21:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm glad he's gone！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.60,1:21:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong with Red？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.50,1:21:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，he's just sad 'cause you left town
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.00,1:21:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,and went to your big race to win the Piston Cup
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.00,1:21:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,that you've always dreamed about your whole life
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.90,1:21:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,and get that big ol' sponsor and that fancy helicopter you was talkin' about.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.10,1:21:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.80,1:21:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knowed you wouldn't leave without saying goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.70,1:21:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doin' here？You're gonna miss your race.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.50,1:21:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry。I'll give you a police escort，and we'll make up time.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.20,1:21:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.50,1:21:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you know I can't go just yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.70,1:22:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，why not？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.20,1:22:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not sure these tires
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.10,1:22:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,can get me to California。Peet stop？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.10,1:22:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，does anybody know what time Luigi's opens？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.50,1:22:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't a believe it！Four new tires！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.80,1:22:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Grazie，Mr。Lightning。Grazie！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.50,1:22:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you look at that！Our first customer in years！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.70,1:22:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am filled with tears of ecstasy，
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.30,1:22:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,for this is the most glorious day of my life！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.30,1:22:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，Luigi，give me the best set of blackwalls you've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.50,1:22:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No，no，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.80,1:22:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't-a know what you want。Luigi know what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.30,1:22:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blackwall tires。They blend into the pavement.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.70,1:22:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,But-a this
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.50,1:22:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whitewall tires！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.40,1:22:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,They say，「Look at me！Here I am！Love me.」
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.60,1:22:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，you're the expert.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.50,1:22:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't forget the spare.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.50,1:22:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perfetto。Guido！Peet stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.70,1:23:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did Luigi tell you，eh？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.70,1:23:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow，you were right。Better than a Ferrari，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.00,1:23:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eh No.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.00,1:23:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow！This organic fuel is great！Why haven't I heard about it before？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.70,1:23:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a conspiracy，man！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.70,1:23:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,The oil companies got a grip on the government！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.30,1:23:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're feedin' us a bunch of lies，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.60,1:23:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，I'll take a case.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.20,1:24:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ka-chow.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.60,1:24:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here she comes！Places，everybody。Hurry！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.70,1:24:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Act natural.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.50,1:24:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，Sally。Buon giorno！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.90,1:24:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，what's goin' on？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.80,1:24:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlecars，
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.00,1:24:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,please welcome the new Lightning McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.60,1:24:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pow！What do you think？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.70,1:24:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Radiator Springs looks pretty good on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.90,1:24:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll say.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.80,1:24:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ka-chow.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.10,1:24:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna fit right in in California.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.50,1:24:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,My goodness。It looks like you've helped everybody in town.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.70,1:24:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，everybody except one.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.70,1:24:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，is it getting dark out？What？What'd he say？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.80,1:24:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me say that again。Is it getting dark out？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.90,1:24:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，what was I supposed to do after that？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.10,1:25:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,They fixed their neon！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.30,1:25:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Low and slow？Oh，yeah，baby！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.60,1:25:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just like in its heyday，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.00,1:25:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's even better than I pictured it。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.80,1:26:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shall we cruise？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.30,1:26:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，thank you，dear。I'd love to！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.70,1:26:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no。Lizzie！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.30,1:26:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I remember when Stanley first asked me to take a drive with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.70,1:26:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Miss Sally。May I have this cruise？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.60,1:26:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course，Mater。Uh-uh-uh！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.40,1:26:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,and again and I said，「No.」 He asked me again，and I said，「No.」
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.90,1:26:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，oh，he was a persistent little bugger for a two-cylinder.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.30,1:26:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finally I said，「All right，one little drive.」
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.20,1:26:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Thanks，Mater.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.40,1:26:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good evenin'，you two.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.20,1:27:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Stanley，I wish you could see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.50,1:27:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that what I think it is？Oh，I don't know，Flo.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.40,1:27:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I haven't had a chance to find out。But I am going to find out。Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.20,1:27:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not that。That.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.90,1:27:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Customers？Customers？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.30,1:27:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Customers，everybody！And a lot of 'em！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.00,1:27:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what to do。Just like we rehearsed.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.30,1:27:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the ghostlight！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.00,1:27:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have found McQueen。We have found McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.50,1:27:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen，over here！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.00,1:27:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，excuse me。Is it true you've been in rehab？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.80,1:27:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you have a nervous breakdown？What？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.00,1:27:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen's wearing whitewalls！Your tires balding？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.90,1:27:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stickers！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.90,1:27:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was McQueen your prisoner？Shoot，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.20,1:27:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're best buds！I ain't braggin' or nothin'，
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.70,1:27:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I was in charge of huntin' him down if he tried to escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.00,1:27:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sally！Sally！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.60,1:27:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you still race for the Piston Cup？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.80,1:28:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stickers？Sally！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.60,1:28:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，give us some bolt！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.00,1:28:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're here！Thank the manufacturer！You're alive！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.60,1:28:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mack？You're here！I can't believe it！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.00,1:28:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are a sight for sore headlights！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.00,1:28:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I lost you，boss。I'll make it up to you！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.80,1:28:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mack，I，I can't believe you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.70,1:28:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that the world's fastest racing machine？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.40,1:28:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that Harv？Yeah。He's in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.50,1:28:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Show us the bolt！Get back，you oil-thirsty parasites！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.50,1:28:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's the old McQueen？Actually，this is my good side here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.10,1:28:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harv！Harv！Give us the bolt！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.10,1:28:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harv？Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.10,1:28:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kid，I'm over here！How you doin'，buddy？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.90,1:28:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,My star client disappears off the face of the earth！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.60,1:28:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you think I'm doing？I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.90,1:28:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm doing great！You're everywhere！Radio，TV，the papers！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.40,1:28:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't buy this kind of publicity！What do you need me for？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.50,1:28:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's just a figure of speech，by the way。You signed a contract.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.10,1:28:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you？I can't even find you on my GPS.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.40,1:28:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm in this little town called Radiator Springs.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.10,1:29:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know Route 66？It's still here！Yeah，that's great，kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.30,1:29:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Playtime is over，pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.60,1:29:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,While the world's been trying to find you Dinoco has had no one to woo.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.50,1:29:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are they gonna woo？Chick！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.20,1:29:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bingo。In fact，check out what's on the plasma right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.90,1:29:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Show us the thunder！You want thunder？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.20,1:29:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want thunder？Ka-chicka，ka-chicka！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.90,1:29:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，that's my bit！You've gotta get to Cali，pronto！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.20,1:29:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just get out of Radiation Stinks now，or Dinoco is history，you hear me？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.30,1:29:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just give me a second here，Harv.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.20,1:29:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，wait。Where are you goin'？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.00,1:29:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in the trailer，baby。Kid！You want a bigger trailer？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.40,1:29:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sally，I I want you to
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.80,1:29:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I wish
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.40,1:29:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you。Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.40,1:29:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was just a road。No。It was much more than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.80,1:30:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，kid！We gotta go。Harv's goin' crazy！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.00,1:30:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gonna have me fired if I don't get you in the truck right now！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.30,1:30:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mack，just hold it for You should go.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.10,1:30:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know，but Good luck in California.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.70,1:30:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope you find what you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.80,1:30:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen，come on！Sally
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.00,1:30:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sally！Show us the bolt，McQueen！The bolt！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.30,1:30:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Lightning，show us the bolt！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.20,1:30:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，get in the trailer。Where's the old McQueen？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.10,1:30:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,The bolt！That's it。That's right，let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.50,1:30:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a big shining star。You're a superstar.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.30,1:30:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't belong there，anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.70,1:30:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa Wait Whoa，whoa，wait，wait！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.50,1:30:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，guys！McQueen's leavin' in the truck！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.80,1:30:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，are you Doc Hudson？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.30,1:31:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Thanks for the call.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.20,1:31:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You called them？It's best for everyone，Sally.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.50,1:31:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Best for everyone or best for you？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.10,1:31:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't get to say goodbye to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.50,1:32:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，race fans。Welcome to what has become，quite simply，
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.90,1:32:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,the biggest event in the history of racing.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.30,1:32:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,A three-way battle for the Piston Cup！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.60,1:32:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a crowd of nearly 200，000 cars
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.10,1:32:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,here at the Los Angeles International Speedway.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.80,1:32:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tickets to this race are hotter than a black leather seat on a hot summer day！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.20,1:32:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,The King，Chick Hicks and Lightning McQueen
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.80,1:32:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,in a 200 lap，winner-takes-all，tiebreaker race.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.20,1:33:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got a lotta miles on me，but let me tell you somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.50,1:33:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd see anything like this。This is exciting！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.60,1:33:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,In fact，the country has almost shut down
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.00,1:33:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,to watch what many experts are calling 「the race of the century.」
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.10,1:33:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，King！Good luck in your last race.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.80,1:33:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've sure been an inspiration to me。Thanks，Junior。Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.00,1:33:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，be careful out there，OK？Yeah，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.20,1:33:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's hot！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.30,1:33:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wanna know the forecast？I'll give you the forecast.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.90,1:33:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,A 100 percent chance of thunder！Ka-chicka！Ka-chicka！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.20,1:33:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say it with me！Ka-chicka！Ka-chicka！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.80,1:33:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，you！No admittance without a garage pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.80,1:33:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，it's OK。Lightning McQueen knows me！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.60,1:33:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Marco，it's a beautiful day for a race，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.80,1:33:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Absolutely，Mr。Andretti。And good morning to you，Fred.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.80,1:33:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mario Andretti knows my name！You gotta let me in now！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.80,1:33:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.20,1:33:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，here we go。Focus。Speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.20,1:34:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.70,1:34:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Victory.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.00,1:34:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,One winner，two losers.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.20,1:34:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Speed。Speed。Speed。Speed
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.90,1:34:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lightnin'！You ready？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.60,1:34:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah，yeah！I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.70,1:34:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mack，thanks for being my pit crew today.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.60,1:34:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it，kid。It's the least I could do.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.20,1:34:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,After all，「Gas Can」 is my middle name.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.70,1:34:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is？Ah Not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.60,1:35:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nelson！Zoom in。Ready，16？Take 16.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.80,1:35:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And there he is，Lightning McQueen！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.10,1:35:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Missing all week，and then he turns up in the middle of nowhere！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.30,1:35:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,In a little town called Radiator Springs.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.70,1:35:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wearin' whitewall tires，of all things.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.00,1:35:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Ka-chicka！Ka-chicka！Ka-chicka！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.40,1:35:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，where you been？I've been kinda lonely.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.80,1:35:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody to hang out with。I mean，except the Dinoco folks.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.80,1:35:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the twins。Of course。The ones that used to be your fans，
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.80,1:35:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,but now they're my fans。Listen to what the twins think
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.80,1:35:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Agh！Shoot！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.00,1:35:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boogity，boogity，boogity，boys！Let's go racin'！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.40,1:36:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，you can do it！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.00,1:36:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，King，make us proud，boy！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.30,1:36:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fifty laps down，and The King is still holding a slim lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.50,1:36:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen's got a run on him！He's lookin' to the inside！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.90,1:36:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Chick slammed the door on him！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.20,1:36:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chick's not making it easy on him today.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.60,1:36:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,He lost momentum，
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.40,1:36:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,and now he's gonna have to chase him back down！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.10,1:36:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen spins out in the infield！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.20,1:36:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just me and the old man，fellas.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.90,1:36:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen just doesn't have it today.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.60,1:36:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，kid，are you all right？I don't know，Mack.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.70,1:36:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think I
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.20,1:36:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't come all this way to see you quit.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.20,1:37:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doc？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.40,1:37:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys，you're here！I can't believe this！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.10,1:37:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew you needed a crew chief，but I didn't know it was this bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.90,1:37:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You said you'd never come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.90,1:37:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I really didn't have a choice。Mater didn't get to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.60,1:37:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goodbye！OK，I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.40,1:37:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，if you can drive as good as you can fix a road
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.00,1:37:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,then you can win this race with your eyes shut.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.30,1:37:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，get back out there！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.60,1:37:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hot snot，we are back in business！Guido！Luigi！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.60,1:37:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're goin' up against professional pit crews.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.00,1:37:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to be fast。They will not know what bit them！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.20,1:37:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kid，you can beat these guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.00,1:37:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find a groove that works for you and get that lap back.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.10,1:38:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it？Oh，wow。That's him！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.10,1:38:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that？That's the Hudson Hornet！The Hudson Hornet's back！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.90,1:38:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It appears McQueen has got himself a pit crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.60,1:38:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And look who he has for a crew chief！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.10,1:38:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，man。It's the Hudson Hornet！Whoa！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.80,1:38:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，dip me in axle grease and call me Slick！It surely is.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.80,1:38:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow，this is history in the making.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.90,1:38:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody has seen the racing legend in over 50 years！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.90,1:38:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Doc！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.40,1:38:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come look at this fellow on the radio。He looks just like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.40,1:38:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen passes on the inside！He's nearly a lap down.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.30,1:38:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can he catch up to them with only 60 laps to go？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.30,1:38:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're goin' great，kid。Just keep your head on.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.90,1:38:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，shrimpie，where did McQueen find you，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.90,1:38:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those round things are called tires，and they go under the car！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.70,1:39:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No，no！You'll have your chance。You will have your chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.80,1:39:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，kid's just tryin' to be a hero，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.10,1:39:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you think of this？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.50,1:39:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，that's it，kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.00,1:39:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.30,1:39:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！Git-R-done！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.90,1:39:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I taught him that。Ka-chow！Ah！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.20,1:39:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a move by McQueen！He's caught up to the leaders.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.30,1:39:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。This is what it's all about.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.20,1:39:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,A three-way battle for the lead，with ten to go！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.00,1:39:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at that boy go out there！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.10,1:40:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.80,1:40:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doc，I'm flat！I'm flat！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.80,1:40:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you get back to the pits？Yeah，yeah。I think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.30,1:40:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，got a yellow。Bring it in。Don't tear yourself up，kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.60,1:40:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We gotta get him back out there fast
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.80,1:40:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,or we're gonna be a lap down，and we'll never win this race！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.80,1:40:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guido！It's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.20,1:40:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，tiny，you gonna clean his windshield？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.40,1:40:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't believe it！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.90,1:40:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was the fastest pit stop I've ever seen！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.70,1:40:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was a great stop，but he's still gotta beat that pace car！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.30,1:40:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's gonna be close.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.70,1:40:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，baby！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.20,1:40:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's back in！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.40,1:40:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guido，you did it！Way to go，Guido！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.60,1:41:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it。We're heading into the final lap and McQueen
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.70,1:41:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,is right behind the leaders。What a comeback！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.20,1:41:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,A hundred and ninety-nine laps！It all comes down to this！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.80,1:41:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it，kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.10,1:41:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've got four turns left。One at a time.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.70,1:41:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drive it in deep and hope it sticks.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.20,1:41:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.30,1:41:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll see about that！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.90,1:41:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen's going inside！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.50,1:41:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chick and King are loose！I think McQueen's out！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.20,1:41:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen saved it！He's back on the track！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.00,1:41:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Float like a Cadillac Sting like a Beemer！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.00,1:42:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lightning McQueen is gonna win the Piston Cup！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.00,1:42:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！You got it！You got it，Stickers！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.70,1:42:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am not comin' in behind you again，old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.80,1:42:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.50,1:42:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I won，baby！Yeah！Oh，yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.50,1:42:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's he up to，Doc？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.00,1:43:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doin'，kid？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.50,1:43:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think The King should finish his last race.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.90,1:43:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just gave up the Piston Cup，you know that？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.90,1:43:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,This grumpy old racecar I know once told me somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.60,1:43:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just an empty cup.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.80,1:43:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Darrell，is pushing on the last lap legal？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.40,1:43:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not really pushin' him。He's just givin' him a little bump draft.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.50,1:43:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。What？What's goin' on？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.30,1:43:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I call racin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.50,1:43:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bravo il mio amico！Way to go，buddy！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.70,1:44:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a lotta love out there，you know，man？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.30,1:44:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't embarrass me，Fillmore。That's my hot rod.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.90,1:44:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，baby，bring it out！Bring out the Piston Cup！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.40,1:44:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ka-chicka！Ka-chicka！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.90,1:44:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！Now，that's what I'm talkin' about！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.90,1:44:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，how come the only one celebrating is me，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.10,1:44:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are the girls？Bring on the confetti！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.40,1:44:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ow！Ow！Easy with the confetti。What's goin' on？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.10,1:44:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，snap some pictures。I gotta go sign my deal with Dinoco！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.50,1:44:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say it with me。Ka-chicka！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.70,1:44:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong with everybody？Where's the happiness？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.90,1:44:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！This is the start of the Chick era！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.90,1:44:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，Lightnin'。You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.80,1:44:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Way to go，King！You're still the car！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.30,1:44:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're The King！Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.70,1:45:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You made us proud，kid！Congrats on the loss，me bucko！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.40,1:45:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got a lotta stuff，kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.20,1:45:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，Doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.00,1:45:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Lightnin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.40,1:45:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,How 'bout comin' over here and talk to me a minute？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.00,1:45:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Son，that was some real racin' out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.10,1:45:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,How'd you like to become the new face of Dinoco？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.50,1:45:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I didn't win.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.10,1:45:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lightnin'，there's a whole lot more to racin' than just winnin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.80,1:45:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was so rusty，when he drove down the street
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.60,1:45:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,buzzards used to circle the car！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.80,1:45:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Mr。Tex，but
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.60,1:45:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,but these Rust-eze guys over there gave me my big break.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.90,1:45:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna stick with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.70,1:45:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I sure can respect that.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.80,1:45:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still，you know，
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.10,1:45:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,if there's ever anything I can do for you，just let me know.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.00,1:46:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I sure appreciate that。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.00,1:46:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，there is one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.00,1:46:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，look at me！I'm flyin'，by golly！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.40,1:46:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm happier than a tornado in a trailer park！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.00,1:46:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it's about-a time we redecorate.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.50,1:46:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi。Lightning McQueen told me this was the best place in the world
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.00,1:46:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,to get tires.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.00,1:46:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,How 'bout setting me and my friends up with three or four sets each？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.30,1:46:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guido！There is a real Michael Schumacher Ferrari in my store.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.60,1:46:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,A real Ferrari！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.00,1:46:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Punch me，Guido。Punch me in the face.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.20,1:46:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the most glorious day of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.90,1:46:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow。Spero che il tuo amico si riprenda.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.60,1:46:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mi dicono che siete fantastici.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.20,1:47:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just passin' through？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.80,1:47:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，I thought I'd stop and stay awhile.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.20,1:47:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hear this place is back on the map。It is？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.50,1:47:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's some rumor floating around that some hotshot Piston Cup racecar
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.30,1:47:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,is setting up his big racing headquarters here.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.90,1:47:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？Ah，well，there goes the town.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.80,1:47:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I really missed you，Sally.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.30,1:47:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I create feelings in others they themselves don't understand and，
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.10,1:47:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,McQueen and Sally parked beneath the tree，
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.20,1:47:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ki-s-s uh in-t！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.20,1:47:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great timing，Mater！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.20,1:47:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hep-non，hip-hep，hi-li-lilly！Whee！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.30,1:47:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's my best friend。What're you gonna do？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.80,1:48:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，Stickers，last one to Flo's buys？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.80,1:48:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。Why don't we just take a drive？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.60,1:48:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hmm Nah.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.90,1:48:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！Ka-chow！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.00,1:49:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，everybody please keep together now.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.10,1:49:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,We is now entering the Doc Hudson wing of the museum.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.90,1:49:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow。Unbelievable。That many wins in a single season.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.00,1:49:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's the real deal，Junior。The Hudson Hornet was my inspiration.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.10,1:49:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，son。Is Doc Hudson here today？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.60,1:49:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，Mrs。The King，I think Doc went out for a drive or somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.00,1:49:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you sure ain't no dirt boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.60,1:49:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not today，old man。I know all your tricks.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.00,1:50:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doc！Doc！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.10,1:50:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not all my tricks，rookie！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.90,1:50:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attention！Kiss the pavement goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.50,1:50:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I'm finished，you'll have mud in places you didn't know you had！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.00,1:50:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo，I've never been off-road！Well，that's gonna change right now！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.10,1:50:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,About face！Drop and give me 20 miles！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.10,1:50:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Go！Go，go，go，go，go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.20,1:50:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，now I got dirt in my rims！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.60,1:50:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh？Look at this！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.70,1:50:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's my hood！It's my hood！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.90,1:50:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ain't seen this thing in 20 years！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.60,1:50:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it fits perfectly。How do I look？Ah-choo！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.30,1:51:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，dang.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.70,1:51:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are a toy car！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.30,1:51:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are a sad，strange little wagon and you have my pity。Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.50,1:51:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah？Well，good riddance，you loony！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.30,1:51:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I hate to break up the road rally，guys，but they're here！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.10,1:51:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Birthday guests at three o'clock！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.50,1:51:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，man！Whoever does the voice of that piggy truck，
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.90,1:51:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm tellin' ya，he's one great actor！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.00,1:51:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're banished，genius！Stuck here in this wasteland without chains！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.30,1:51:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，Mike，the Boomobile's in trouble！She needs our help！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.10,1:51:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're still not listening！Ah！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.50,1:51:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Himalayas！Snow cone？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.40,1:51:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，that Abominable Snowplow is quite the comic thespian！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.60,1:51:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just get in there。Go！Go，go，go！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.70,1:51:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Circus cars？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.20,1:52:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,How can you be circus cars？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.70,1:52:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,These are the lousiest circus cars in the world，
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.30,1:52:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,and they're gonna make me rich！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.40,1:52:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute here.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.60,1:52:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're just usin' the same actor over and over.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.10,1:52:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What kind of a cut-rate production is this？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.50,1:55:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，for the love of Chrysler，can we please ask someone for directions？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.30,1:55:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！There's an on-ramp close！I know it！I can feel it！
